---
Śābdanirṇaya of Prakāśātmayati (NB probably 10th century)

From TSS edition of 1917

Critical edition Hugo David 2020
Typed by Harunaga Isaacson
---

yasyāḥ prasādamavalambya jagadgurūṇāmapyaskhaladbahuguṇāḥ prasaranti vācaḥ|
sā vedaśāstraparinirmitavandyadehā bhūyātsamagravaradaiva sarasvatī vaḥ|| 1

vighnābhitāpamabhihatya madīyakṛtyabījaṃ pravṛddhamadanugrahavarṣapātaiḥ|
samprārthitaḥ sitataro 'pi gaṇeśameghaḥ siñcannabhīṣṭaphalamaṅkurayatvamogham|| 2

yeṣāṃ pādarajaḥsaṅghairdhvāntapaṅkanirāsibhiḥ|
ātmā me svacchatāṃ yātastānnamāmi gurūnaham|| 3

natvā brahma yathā śābdānmānāttattattvamīkṣyate|
tathā vayaṃ nibadhnīmaḥ svabuddhipariśuddhaye|| 4

śābdapramāṇasvarūpādhigamādhīnā tasya viṣayaviśeṣe sāmarthyāvadhāraṇeti śābdapramāṇasvarūpaṃ nirūpayituṃ lokaprasiddhameva tallakṣaṇamanuvadati---

śabdavijñānajā yārthe 'sannikṛṣṭe suniścitā|
buddhistacchābdamānaṃ hi saṃgirante vipaścitaḥ|| 5

śabdavijñānādasannikṛṣṭe 'rthe buddhiḥ śābdapramāṇamiti saṃgrahaḥ|| 


tallakṣaṇopaniviṣṭānāṃ viśeṣaṇānāṃ nivartanīyāni matāntarāṇi darśayati---

vakturvivakṣā mānaṃ vā viṣaye liṅgato 'pi ca|
buddhirmānāntarecchā ca nivāryante viśeṣaṇaiḥ|| 6

atra kecidāhuḥ ---vakturvākyārthaviṣaye vivakṣāṃ pramāṇāntaraṃ vā samadhigamayanti śabdā nārthamātram|
tayośca śabdasamadhigatayorarthavyavahārahetutvamiti|
taduktaṃ dharmakīrtinā---vakturabhipretaṃ tu sūcayetyuriti|
tānpratyāha---arthe buddhiriti|

yadapi mataṃ dve eva pramāṇe pratyakṣamanumānaṃ ca|
ato na śābdādeva kevalādarthasamadhigamaḥ kiṃ tvarthenānubandhavato liṅgāt|
taduktam---

pratyakṣamanumānaṃ ca pramāṇe sadṛśātmanā|
apratyakṣasya sambandhādanyataḥ pratipattitaḥ||

iti|
śābdī ca buddhiranumā sāmānyadvāreṇa bodhakatvātpratyakṣādanyapramāṇatvāttrailokyaviṣayatvātsambandhajñānasāpekṣatvācca dhūmādagnijñānavadityarthaḥ|
tannirākaraṇāyāha---śabdavijñānāditi|
yattu---āptopadeśa āgamaḥ 
iti lakṣaṇātpramāṇāntarasāpekṣamarthamavagamayanti śabdā iti tatrāha---asannikṛṣṭa iti||

idānīmādye nirākaraṇaprakāramāha---

pravṛttyā na vivakṣādhīrmīyate 'rthaikaniṣṭhayā|
prayogahetutāmeva paścādapi samīkṣate|| 7

tatra na tāvacchabdebhyo vivakṣādhīsamadhigamaḥ|
bālo hi pravṛttiliṅgenārthaviṣayeṇa śabdavijñānasamanantarabhāvinā viśiṣṭārthaviṣayāmeva buddhiṃ śabdakāryatvenānumimīte na vakturvivakṣādigocarāṃ tatpratipattau pramāṇābhāvāt|

nanu vyutpannaḥ svayaṃ śabdaṃ prayuñjānaḥ svasākṣikaṃ vivakṣādibhāvamavagamya pūrvasyāpi pratipattustatsadbhāvamanumānenāvagacchati|
tathā pūrvo 'pi pratipattā svaprayoktṛgatavivakṣādibhāvaṃ svātmānumānena tadānīmevāvagacchatīti tasyāṃ buddhau paścācchabdasāmarthyaṃ pratipadya tenaitatprayogahetutāmeva vivakṣāderayaṃ svātmanyavagacchati na śabdaviṣayatāṃ tatra sāmarthyājñānāt|
tathaiva pūrvayorapi vaktṛpratipattrorityavagacchanna tatra śabdasāmarthyaṃ kalpayati|
kiṃ ca vivakṣādirna kevalaḥ śabdārtho 'rthe vyavahārāt|
kiṃ cānupapattyā viṣayākṣepe yaṃ kaṃcidviṣayamavalambeta|
arthavyāvṛttaścedartha eva tarhi tadgocaro 'vyabhicārāt|
savikalpake cārthamātre 'bhilāpaviśeṣānuṣaṅgādvivakṣāderanumeyatayānyathāsiddheḥ|
tadvācakapadābhāvādapadārthasya vākyārthatve 'tiprasaṅgācca|
tasmādyathāsāmarthyajñānamartha eva śabdagocara iti|| 7

idānīmanumānapakṣaṃ nirācaṣṭe---

svabhāvakārye na syātāṃ deśādiniyamo 'pi na|
nānumā śaktisambandhānnekṣyate pakṣadharmatā|| 8

trirūpāṇi trīṇyeva liṅgāni svabhāvakāryānupalabdhayaḥ|
tatra na tāvacchabdārthayoranupalabdhiḥ sambandho bhāvarūpatvāt|
gotvasyāpratipattāvagotvavyāvṛttyasiddheḥ kalpanāyogācca nāpohaḥ śabdārthaḥ|
nāpi vṛkṣatvaśiṃśapātvayoriva tayoḥ svabhāvānubandha ekārthasamavāyena tādātmyābhāvāt|
na ca vivakṣādināpyekārthasamavāya ekadeśānupalabdheḥ|
nāpi dhūmāgnyoriva kāryakāraṇatā pramāṇābhāvāt|
nāpi vivakṣāmātraprabhavaḥ śabdaḥ|
govivakṣāprabhavo gośabda iti cet---vivakṣāviṣayasya gośabdenābhilāpaḥ kathaṃ tasya tadavagamyatvābhāve tadvivakṣājanyatvāt(iti cenna?)| arthasyāvastutvenāhetutvābhyupagamāt|
savikalpake ca tāvanmātre 'bhilāpasaṃsargāttatraiva sambandhajñānācchabdasya vivakṣādijanyatve 'pyarthe 'pi bodhakatvasambandho vidyata eva|
nāpyanayordeśaniyamo yasminsnigdhacchāyā tasmiñchaityamitivat|
nāpi kālaniyamo yasminghaṭikādvaye kṛttikopdayastasminrohiṇyāsaktiritivat|
avyavasthitadeśakālatvāt|
tasmādanayoravinābhāvābhāvānnārthasya śabdo liṅgam|
kutastarhi sambandhācchabdādarthapratipattiḥ|
tadbuddhisāmarthyalakṣaṇāt|
arthenānubandhābhāve kathaṃ tadbuddhisāmarthyam|
na vayamarthenānubandhaṃ brūmaḥ kiṃ tu tadbuddhyā|
sa ca tajjananasāmarthyalakṣaṇo 'nubandha iṣyate|
nanvanubandhāntarābhāve kathaṃ tadbuddhau sāmarthyaṃ kṛśānoriva dhūmajanane|
na hi tatra tatsāmarthyādanyo 'nubandho 'sti|
atha tatra vahnimātraṃ kāraṇaṃ na sāmarthyaṃ nāmāsti tathāpi vahnerdhūmo jāyate cecchabdebhyo 'rthabuddhayo 'pi jāyantām|
atha jñānakārye 'nubandhāntarāpekṣā na kāryamātre|
na cakṣuṣyarthabuddhisāmarthyavyatiriktasyānubandhasyādarśanāt|
atha pratipannārthabuddhiranubandhāntaranimittā nādarśanācchabdārthayoḥ|

syāttarhi śaktilakṣaṇādevānubandhādanumānam|
na sambandhāntaraviśiṣṭasyaiva buddhisāmarthye 'numānatvaprasiddheḥ|
nanu pratipannasambandhādbuddhiranumānam|
satyam|
arthena pratipannasambandhāttadbuddhisāmarthyavilakṣaṇānna tu tadbuddhisāmarthyasambandhādeva buddhiranumānam|

nanvetāvatā kathaṃ pramāṇavailakṣaṇyam|
kā vā pramāṇavailakṣaṇyasyeyattā|
api ca dharmadharmipakṣadharmatādṛṣṭāntāśca śabdasyārthabodhane na nirūpyante|
tato 'pyanumānavailakṣaṇyam|
nanvata eva bodhasāmagryabhāvācchabdānāmaprāmāṇyaṃ syāt|
na dhūmādagnibuddhāviva śabdebhyo 'rthapratipattāvarthāvisaṃvādadarśanāt|
tathā ca prayogaḥ|
nānumānaṃ śabdaḥ pratipattavyasambandhāntaranirapekṣatve satyarthabuddhisamarthatvāccakṣurvat|

tasmādajñātatayā svasāmarthyādevāvagamahetuḥ pratyakṣam|
trairūpyopetatayā gṛhītādbuddhiranumānam|
tadbuddhisamarthatayā gṛhītācchabdāttatra buddhirāgama iti pramāṇāntaratvam|
tasmādyuktaṃ śabdavijñānāditi|

idānīṃ mānāntarasāpekṣatvapakṣe nirākaraṇaprakāramāha---

śabdo mānāntarāpekṣo vede loke ca neṣyate|
vaktṛmānaṃ ca śabdasya prāptadoṣāpanodi hi|| 9

vede tu mānāntarānapekṣatvamapauruṣeyatvapratipādanena vakṣyāmaḥ|
pauruṣeye tu vaktṛjñānaṃ kvopayujyatāmiti vivektavyam|
yadi vākārthajñāne tatpramitau veti mataṃ tatra na tāvadvaktṛjñānamanavagatameva tadubhayaṃ janayati pratipatturbuddhidvāreṇāpi tatsambandhābhāvātkartṛkaraṇayośca kriyotpattau sambandhāpekṣatvāt|
avagataṃ cetkathamanavagate 'pramite cārthe tadvyāvṛttaṃ vaktṛjñānaṃ gamyeta| 
na ca nirviṣayamavagamyamānaṃ kvacitpramitihetuḥ|

nanu padebhyo 'vabudhyante padārthāḥ|
satyam|
na tāvanmātre vaktṛjñānamapekṣyate|
tarhi sāmānyato darśanenotprekṣayā vā saṃsargo 'pi pratīyatāṃ pratīta evāsminnidānīṃ padānāṃ padāvabuddhānāṃ vā padārthānāṃ padātiriktasya vā vākyasya saṃsargāvagamasāmarthyasaṃkathā yataḥ|
satsvapi padādiṣvasati ca viśiṣṭavaktṛjñānāvagame saṃsarganiścayābhāvātsati ca tasminpadādyabhāve saṃsarganiścayābhāvādarśanāttata eva tanniścayasiddheḥ kāraṇakāraṇatayānyathāsiddhatvātpadādīnāṃ na saṃsargasahakārikāraṇatāpi sidhyet|
tatra kathaṃ lokasiddhaśaktisavyapekṣe vaktṛjñānavikale vede|
aviśiṣṭastu vākyārtha iti padebhya eva saṃsargasiddhiḥ|

nanu śaktigrahaṇakāle saṃsarge śaktiravagatā|
satyaṃ pratipattikāle nāsāvupayujyate vaktṛjñānādeva saṃsarganiścayāt|
athavā tatrāpi pratipattikāle dṛṣṭenaiva nyāyena saṃsargaśaktigraho vibhramaḥ kalpyeta|
tasmātsāmarthyagrahaṇānusāreṇa śabdebhya eva saṃsarganiścayo vaktavyaḥ|

tatra mānāntaravirodhādyathāprayogamananviteṣu padārtheṣu tadabhidhāyināṃ śabdānāmitaretarānvayayogyavibhaktisambandhitayā saṃhatya buddhau saṃnidhānaṃ śabdānāṃ doṣastato bhrāntijñānam|
sa ca śabdagato doṣaḥ prayoktṛgatenārthaviṣayeṇa bhrāntijñānenotprekṣājñānena vā jāyate prayogadvāreṇetyanvayavyatirekābhyāmavagamyate|
tatra vaktṛpramāṇaṃ tathāvidhadoṣanirākaraṇamukhenopayujyate na pramitihetutayā|

puruṣasambandhe satyāśaṅkitadoṣatvānniyamena tadapekṣyate|
vede punaritaretarānvayayogyavibhaktiyuktapadasaṃnidhānabuddhestadarthapravṛttajñānāntaranimittaprayogajanyatvābhāvānna doṣaśaṅkā|
nāpi tannnirāsāpekṣeti nairapekṣyamityucyate 'nyathā na vede pramitilābha ityuktam|
tadevaṃ loke 'pi na pramitāvapekṣā|

nanu svaviṣayajñānāntarajanyā smṛtiḥ sāpekṣā tathehāpi syāt|
tanna|
mānāntarasambhinnārthatvāttatra sāpekṣatānyathānumāne vyāpako 'gniriti vyāptijñānajanye 'pi tathā syāt|
na tatheha sambhedaḥ|
śabdasyārthamātre sāmarthyāditi|
tasmādyuktamasaṃnikṛṣṭagrahaṇam|

athaḥ samīcīnameva śābdalakṣaṇamiti sthitam|
kiṃ punaḥ śabdaśabdenābhidhīyate yadākāravijñānādarthe buddhiḥ śābdī|
jātirityāha---

śabdaśabdo 'pi tajjātāvakhaṇḍatvādadṛṣṭataḥ|
upādheḥ prāgvikalpācca pratyabhijñā ca lokavat|| 10

ekasyābhidhānasya vibhinnārthavṛttitā pratītā śaktibhedaṃ sāmānyaṃ vāvalambate|
śaktibhede tvabhidheyānantyātsambandhajñānāśaktiḥ kalpanāgauravaṃ ca syāt|

syādetat---yathā pācakaśabdastadubhayaṃ nāpekṣate tadvadihāpi syāditi|
naitadyuktam|
tatra yaugikatvācchabdasyāvayavārthasāmānyayogena vibhidyamāneṣvartheṣu tadubhayamantareṇāpi pravṛttisambhavāt|
ayaṃ punarakhaṇḍaḥ śabdo nāvayavaśaktyā śabdaviśeṣānāheti sāmānyamevālambanīyam|

nanvidaṃ tatkāraṇamityādayaḥ śabdāstaṭasthamevopādhimavalambya viśeṣābhidhāyinastathehāpi śrotragrāhyatvaṃ taṭasthamevāvalambya viśeṣāneva śabdaśabdo 'pyabhidhattām|
tannānavagatopādhāvaupādhikābhidhānaparāmarśānupapatteḥ|
na hīdānīmupalabhyamāne 'pūrve śabdaviśeṣe tatparāmarśaḥ śrotratajñānatadgrāhyatvānāmanadhyakṣatvāt|
prathamapratyaye ca tatrābhidhānamanurajyate|

nanu viṣayasaṃvedanānumitena śrotragrāhyatvenopalakṣite tasminnabhidhānaparāmarśaḥ syāt|
na śrotragrāhyatayā pūrvapratipannasamānākāraviṣayatadabhidhānavikalpānuṣaktāvagamamantareṇa tadgrāhyatānumānāyogāt|
na hi saṃvedyamātrasaṃvedanaṃ tadgrāhyatāvagamahetuḥ|
na hi tadānīmevānvayavyatirekābhyāṃ tadgrāhyatāvagantuṃ śakyata indriyāntarāṇāmapi saṃnidhānāt|
na cendriyāntaragrāhyavailakṣaṇyena tadgrāhyatānumānaṃ tadgrāhyāntarādapi vailakṣaṇyasya bhāvāt|
sālakṣaṇye ca sāmānyasiddhiḥ|
na copādherapyekatvamasti śrotrādīnāṃ bhinnatvānnityānumeyeṣu sāmānyāyogāt|

ato 'pūrvaśabdopalambhe 'pyabhidhānānuṣaṅgāya śaktibhedaparihārāya śrotragrāhyatāvagamāya ca prathamapratyayāvagamyaṃ sāmānyamevopagantavyam|

nanu sāmānyaṃ pratyabhijñādhīnātmalābhaṃ tadabhāve nāvakāśamarhati|
na tāvatso 'yamityavamarśaḥ pratyabhijñā prasiddhasāmānye 'pyasti|
yadi buddhāvākāramātrānusaṃdhānamastyeva tarhi śabdaṃ dṛṣṭavataḥ śabdāntare 'rthādvilakṣaṇākārapratipattiryena prathamamabhidhānānuṣaṅgaḥ syādityuktam|
na ca dravyarasādisamānaṃ śabdāntaraṃ pratīyate|
kiṃ ca śrotrādyupādhau caikatvakalpanādvārabahidheyaikatvakalpanam|

mā bhūccodāttānudāttapaṭumṛdutvādīnāṃ śrotragrāhyatayā śabdaśabdārthatodāttaḥ śabda ityādinā śabdena dharmiṇāsāmānādhikaraṇyāt|
tasmājjātikalpanaiva śreyasī|
atastajjātyuparaktajñānādarthe buddhiḥ śābdīti sthitam|

idānīmarthapratipattinimittaṃ śabdaṃ vimṛśati---

varṇātiriktaśabdādvā varṇavijñānasaṃskṛtaiḥ|
smārakairvātiriktairvā varṇebhyo vārthadhīrbhavet|| 11

varṇebhyo 'tiriktādekaśabdapratyayālambanātpadasaṃjñakātpadārthapratyaya ityeke saṃgirante|
varṇavijñānasaṃskārairvarṇasmṛtihetubhirityanye|
taireva smārakasaṃskārātiriktairarthapratyaya ityapare|
varṇebhya eveti kecit|

tatrāntyaṃ pakṣamātmīyatvena svīkaroti---

varṇāḥ svajñānasaṃskāraiḥ sambhūya smṛtikāribhiḥ|
krameṇaikasmṛtau buddhā bodhayantyarthamañjasā|| 12

tadetatpūrvapakṣanirākaraṇamukhena pratipādayituṃ varṇavyatiriktaśabdavādaṃ varṇayati---

varṇānnaikaikato buddhirupalabdhātsato 'pi vā|
adṛṣṭerupalabdhādvā smṛtādvā saṃhatānna dhīḥ|| 13

ayogātsamudāyasya kāraṇānāṃ ca bhedataḥ|
ato varṇātiriktātsā śabdādeveti gamyate|| 14

asti tāvadgakārādivarṇopalabdhyanantaramarthabuddhiḥ|
sā kiṃ varṇebhya eva tadvyatiriktācchabdādveti vivecanīyam|

na tāvadekaikasmādvarṇādupalabdhādanupalabdhādvā sādṛṣṭeḥ|
nāpi varṇasamudāyāttadabhāvāt|
ata eva na varṇasamudāyopalabdheḥ smṛtervārthapratyayaḥ|
upalabdhikāraṇānāṃ ca varṇoccāraṇānāṃ kramavartitayā bhedātsaṃskārāṇāṃ ca smṛtihetūnāṃ prativarṇaṃ nirapekṣasmṛtihetutayā bhinnatvānna yugapatsamastavarṇopalabdhiḥ smṛtirvā sambhavati|

ato 'rthabuddhikāryapariśeṣānumānakalpitādvarṇabhede 'pyeko 'yaṃ śabda iti pratyakṣāvaseyādanyataḥ śabdādarthāvagama iti|

idānīmimaṃ pakṣaṃ nirākaroti---

varṇātireki nādhyakṣaṃ varṇāḥ sopādhikāḥ padam|
arthe 'buddhe padaṃ naikaṃ yogaḥ śabdāntare 'pi na|| 15

na tāvadvarṇavyatiriktaṃ padaṃ varṇasamavetaṃ ghaṭādivatsvatantraṃ vā pratyakṣeṇāvagamyate|
nanvekamidaṃ padamiti bhinnavarṇātiriktaṃ padamadhyakṣyate|
na tāvacchrotrendriyeṇa yugapadgakārādivarṇatrayopalambhāyogāt|
na ca varṇopalambhavikalaḥ śabdapratyayaḥ|
na ca gakāramātre padamabhivyajyate gaṅgādipadānāmapi tulyatvāt|
satyaṃ tatraivābhivyajyate kiṃ tūttaravarṇābhyāṃ viśeṣeṇa paricchidyate|
evamapi varṇatrayāvamarśamantareṇa na viśiṣṭārthāvabodhakaṃ padamabhivjyate|
sa cāvamarśo na śrotrendriyanibandhano 'sambhavāt|
na ca gakāramātra eva gotvamiva khaṇḍādau varṇātiriktaṃ kiṃcitpadamabhivyajyate|

nāpi mānasapratyakṣaṃ padaṃ sakṛdvarṇatrayānavamarśāt|
ekaikavarṇapratyayajanitasaṃskāre 'ntyavarṇapratyayajanitaparipāke ca manasyadhyaṣyata iti cet---na varṇatrayānuparāgeṇānavabhāsanātteṣāṃ yugapaduparāgānupapatteśca|
atha varṇopalabdhijanitasaṃskārāḥ sambhūyāśeṣavarṇaviṣayakaṃ smṛtijñānamekaṃ sampādayeyuḥ|
na tarhi smaryamāṇavarṇālambipadavijñānaṃ pratyakṣaṃ smaryamāṇaghaṭagataśauklyavat|
kiṃ ca tādṛśādeva smṛtivijñānādarthabuddhisiddherna padakalpanārthavatī|

nanvavabhāsate padam|
satyaṃ varṇā evaikārthabodhanasāmarthyopādhau vanavatpadabuddhibhājaḥ|
nanu śaktyavadhāraṇāyāḥ prāgapi padamavagamyate|
nānabhyastabhāsāyāmudāhriyamāṇāyāmavyutpannasya padavibhāgajñānābhāvādekānekatvābhyāṃ padasaṃdehāt|
saṃhitāsvapyadhyetṛṇāṃ padavyavahārastathāvidhabuddhimadvyavahāraparamparānibandhanaḥ|
ataḥ padabuddhiraupādhikī varṇaviṣayaiva||

nanu varṇebhyo nārthapratyaya ityuktam|
satyamavabodhakapadābhivyaktāvapyuktānupapattistulyā|
athaikaiva varṇatrayāvalambinī smṛtiḥ padamabhivyanakti|
sā tarhyarthābhivyaktāvapi samānā|
vaktavyā ca sā padābhivyañjakavarṇasaṃkhyāniyamavyavahārāya|
na hi saṃkhyeyāvamarśamantareṇa saṃkhyopalabhyate|
tasmādvarṇavyatiriktapadakalpanākāraṇābhāvādvarṇebhya evārthapratipattiriti ramaṇīyam|

dvitīyaṃ pūrvapakṣaṃ varṇayati---

smārakā eva saṃskārāḥ smṛtibhiḥ samprabodhitāḥ|
arthadhīlabdhasāmarthyā bodhayantyarthamañjasā|| 16

varṇopalambhajanitasaṃskārā varṇasmṛtihetava evārthaṃ pratyāyayanti|
nanvanupalabdhānāṃ cakṣurādivatkathaṃ pratyāyakatvam|
naiṣa doṣaḥ svakāryavarṇaviṣayasmaraṇasamunnītānāṃ tadupapatteḥ|
nanvadṛṣṭā saṃskārebhyo 'pūrvārthādhigatiḥ|
satyam| ihāntyavarṇapratyayasahakāribhyastebhya eva pratyabhijñeva samprayogasahitātpūrvopalambhasaṃskārādarthādhigatirityanantarakāryadarśanādevāvagamyate|

ucyate---

smārakādarthadhīrna syādanyatrānupalabdhitaḥ|
sāmyātprasiddhervarṇebhyaḥ kramasiddhebhya eva sā|| 17

na tāvadanyajñānasaṃskāro 'nyamarthamavagamayatyadarśananiyamāt|
kāryasāmarthyātkalpyata iti cet---tarhi tata eva kramopalabdhānāmeva varṇānāṃ sāmarthyaṃ kalyatām|
nanvantyavarṇapratyayātpūrvakṣaṇavartināṃ pūrvavarṇopalambhānāṃ kathaṃ kālavyavadhānena kāryasāmarthyamadṛṣṭapūrvaṃ kalpyate|
samānametadyugapadbhāvisaṃskāreṣvadṛṣṭasāmarthyakalpanam|
kaḥ punarnirṇayahetuḥ|
anupapattisāmyācchabdādarthapratipattiprasiddheśca varṇopalambhapakṣa eva śreyān|
pratyabhijñāyāmapi smṛtyaṃśa eva saṃskārājjāyate nāpūrvādhigamaḥ|

na cāntyavarṇapratyayo 'pi sahakārī|
yadi tāvatpadebhya eva saṃsargabuddhirāśrīyate tadā vākyāntyavarṇapratyayasamaye padāntyavarṇapratyayānāmanavasthānāt|
na ca vākyāntyavarṇapratyaya eva kṛtsnapadasahakārī tasyānavasthitavarṇaviśeṣasya padeṣvantarbhāve padānavadhāraṇaprasaṅgātpratiprayogaṃ padasvarūpabhedādanantarbhāve saṃskāramātrasya padasya svābhidheyapadārthāṃśabodhane sāmarthyābhāvaḥ sthita eva|
padebhyaḥ padārthāstebhyaḥ saṃsarga ityetannirākariṣyate|

api ca---

vyutkrame vaktṛbhede ca syātsaṃskārāviśeṣataḥ|
kṛtsnasaṃskāradhīhānātsambandhādigrahaśca na|| 18

vyutkramaprayukteṣvapi varṇeṣu saṃskārāviśeṣādarthabuddhiḥ syāt|
varṇapakṣe 'pi tathā kiṃ na syāt| kramaviśeṣaniyamāt|
tarhi saṃskāre 'pi sa niyamaḥ syāt|
na tāvadutpattikramaniyamasteṣāmarthabodhane viniyujyate 'ntyavarṇasaṃskārajanmānantaramutpattīnāmativṛttatayā tatkramasyāpyativṛtteḥ|
na ca deśakālakramo yugapadekatrāvasthānāt|

nanu na varṇānāmapi deśakālakramo vyāpitvānnityatvācca|
upalabdhikramastvantyavarṇopalabdhyanantaramativṛttaḥ|
satyamaśeṣavarṇāvamarśismṛtivijñānoparaktatayātivṛttasyāpi kramasya hetutvābhyupagamādupalabdhikramapakṣasyānaṅgīkaraṇānna doṣaḥ|
vaktavyā ca tathāvidhā smṛtiranyathaitāvadbhirevaṃkramakaiśca varṇairekapadabuddhigocarairutpannāḥ saṃskārā ekamarthamadhigamayantīti kramasaṃkhyāviśiṣṭavarṇapadavyavahārādyayogaḥ|
taduktamautpattikasūtre vārttikakāraiḥ ---

antyavarṇe ca vijñāte sarvasaṃskārakāritam|
smaraṇaṃ pūrvavarṇeṣu sarveṣvanye pracakṣate||

iti siddhāntatvena|
ato vyutkramaprayukteṣu syādevārthabuddhiḥ|

bhinnavaktṛkeṣvapi kramaviśiṣṭatayānusandhīyamāneṣūtpadyamānārthabuddhiḥ saṃskārapakṣe tadanapekṣā syāt|
syāttarhi kramopahitasaṃskārabuddhirarthādhigamahetu|
na tadupalambhakāraṇābhāvāt|
varṇasmṛtikāryāṇyevopalambhakāraṇamiti cet---na teṣāmapi kramavartitvātkramopahitasakalavarṇaviṣayaikajñānāyogāt|

kiṃ cāsminpakṣe sambandhijñānātsambandhajñānaṃ jñātācchabdādarthabuddhiḥ savikalpake cābhidhānānusmṛtirityādivyavahāro duḥsampādaḥ|
atha kramasaṃsṛṣṭāśeṣavarṇāvamarśismṛtijñānopagamādevaitatsarvaṃ sampatsyata iti|
tarhi tata evārthasiddheḥ saṃskāreṣu sāmarthyakalpanā durlabhaiva|

tasmātsaṃskārāṇāmapūrvasāmarthyāyogātprasiddhivirodhādvyutkramādiṣu prasaṅgātsambandhajñānādyayogācca na saṃskārapakṣaḥ śreyānkiṃ tu varṇasmṛtipakṣa eveti sthitam||

ye tu smārakasaṃskāravyatiriktānarthāvabodhakānapūrvasaṃskārāneva kalpayanti tānpratyāha---

ayuktālaukikī k.lptiḥ saṃskāre k.lptigauravāt|
padādevārthasambuddhestatra k.lptirlaghīyasī|| 19

avaśyaṃ hi tvayāpi varṇātiriktaṃ padaṃ nirākurvatāśeṣavarṇāvamarśivijñānaṃ padavyavahārāyopagantavyam|
tadānīṃ tata evārthasiddhernālaukikasaṃskārakalpanāvakāśaḥ|
kalpanāgauravācca---varṇajñānānāmapūrvasaṃskārasāmarthyaṃ saṃskārasvarūpāṇi teṣāmarthabuddhisāmarthyaṃ ceti|
nāyaṃ doṣo varṇasmṛtipakṣe|

nanu na saṃskārā niyamena smṛtimutpādayanti yato niyamenāntyavarṇānantaramarthabuddhiḥ syāt|
apūrvasaṃskārapakṣe 'pi samāno 'yaṃ doṣaḥ|
kāryadarśanānniyamenotpādakatvakalpanā varṇasmṛtipakṣe 'pi tulyā|
tasmātsmaryamāṇavarṇebhya eva padārthapratipattiriti sthitam||

tathā ca devatādhikaraṇe bhāṣyam---vṛddhavyavahāre ceme varṇāḥ kramānugṛhītā gṛhītārthaviśeṣasambandhāśca santaḥ svavyavahāre 'pyekaikavarṇagrahaṇānantaraṃ samastapratyavamarśinyāṃ buddhau tādṛśā eva pratyavabhāsamānāstaṃ tamarthamavyabhicāreṇa pratyāyayiṣyantīti|

idānīṃ vākyārthapratipattinimittaṃ śabdaṃ vimṛśati---

gṛhītapadasambandhādvākyādvāpadabhāginaḥ|
padārthebhyaḥ padebhyo vā saṃsargaṃ pratijānate|| 20

gṛhītapadapadārthasambandhātpadavyatiriktādeva vākyādavibhaktaipadātmakādviśiṣṭasaṃsargapratipattiriti kecitpratijānate|
padāvabuddhebhyaḥ padārthebhya ityapare|
padebhya eva saṃsṛṣṭābhidhānasamarthebhyaḥ saṃsargapratyaya ityanye pratipedire|

tatrāntyaṃ pakṣamātmīyatvena svīkaroti---

padairevānvitasvārthapratipādanaśaktibhiḥ|
guṇapradhānabhāvātmā saṃsargaḥ pratipādyate|| 21

pakṣāntaranirākaraṇamukhenaitatpratipādayituṃ prathamaṃ vākyapakṣaṃ nirācaṣṭe---

tanmānābhāvato 'jñānādānantyātsaṃgatestathā|
śaktyānantyātprayogāṇāṃ bhedādvākyaṃ na bodhakam|| 22

na tāvatpadavyatiriktaṃ vākyaṃ padasamavetaṃ ghaṭādivatsvatantraṃ vā śrotreṇa manasā vā pratyakṣeṇopalabdhuṃ śakyamekavākyatābuddheḥ padavadviśiṣṭaikārthasāmarthyopādhinibandhanatvādanabhyastabhāṣāyāṃ tathānavagamāt|

api cābhyupagame 'pi pratiprayogaṃ padāvāpoddhārābhyāṃ bhidyamānasya vākyasya padaśaktibhyo vyatiriktaśaktimataśca śakyena sambandhagrahaṇamaśakyasampādanam|
naivaṃ padapadārthasambandhajñānāditi cet---kathamanyasya sambandhajñānādanyo 'rthamavagamayet|

atha nātyantamanyāni padāni vākyātkiṃ tu tadeva paropādhivibhāgena padānīti kathyate|
naitatsāram|
gaurityakhaṇḍasyāpi padasya śaktibhede pṛthaksambandhajñānamapekṣyate kimu śaktimadbhede 'pi|
atha tatrābhidheyabhedāttadapekṣeha tu padārthā eva saṃsṛṣṭā vākyārtha iti na pṛthagvākyasya śaktigrahaṇāpekṣā|
na pratipādyabhedātsaṃsargaśabdasyeva pṛthakśaktijñānāpekṣeti na śaktigrahaṇamupapadyate|
na cāgṛhītasambandhaṃ vākyaṃ bodhayati padavacchabdatvāt|

tathā padatacchaktivyatiriktavākyatacchaktikalpanāyāṃ pratiprayogaṃ bhedātkalpanāgauravaṃ ca syāt|
tathā ca śiśo gāmānaya gāṃ badhānārbhaka gāmānaya gāṃ badhāna bāla gāmānaya gāṃ badhāna ḍimbha gāmānaya gāṃ badhānetyaṣṭānāṃ prayogānāmaṣṭau vākyāni tacchaktayaśca kalpayitavyāḥ|
padavādinastu saptaiva|
tathā śuklāmiti padāntaraprayoge vākyabhedātpunaraṣṭau vākyāni tacchaktayaśca kalpayitavyāḥ|
padavādinastvekaiva śaktistasmādvākyapakṣo mudhā|

idānīṃ padārthapakṣaṃ pratijānīte---

padārthānpratipādyaiva nivartante padānyataḥ|
padārthā eva saṃsargaṃ bodhayantyūrdhvamañjasā|| 23

padebhyaḥ pratipannānāṃ padārthānāṃ svātmasaṃsargapratipādanamabhihitānvayo nāma pūrvavādinā pratijñātaḥ|

tatra pramāṇamāha---

āvāpoddhāralabdhārthaprayojakasamāśrayāt|
vyavadhānātpadebhyo 'rthakramavatpratyayairapi|| 24

saṃsargasiddherarthebhyo 'pyanyathāsiddhitastayoḥ|
svarūpamātre sāmarthyaṃ padānāmavasīyate|| 25

gāmānaya gāṃ badhānāśvamānayāśvaṃ badhānetyādiprayogabhedeṣu gośabdāvāpe gorūpamātrāvāpāttaduddhāre coddhārāttāvanmātrasyaiva gośabdābhidheyatā nārthāntaratatsaṃsargayorvyabhicārāt|
tathā pratipattikāle 'pi gavādiśabdebhyaḥ krameṇārthamātrapratyayā eva jāyante nārthāntaratatsaṃsargapratyayāḥ|
saṃsargapratyayastvantyapadārthapratyayātparācīnaḥ|
tadevaṃ prayogapratyayābhyāmarthasvarūpamātre padasāmarthye 'vagate vākyaprayogasamanantarabhāvinaḥ saṃsargapratyayasyānanyathāsiddhānvayavyatirekābhyāṃ padārthā eva hetavaḥ kalpyante|

nanu pravṛttiliṅgena saṃsargapratyaya evānvayavyatirekābhyāṃ śabdakāryatvena gamyate|
tanna kāraṇakāraṇaviṣayatayā tayoranyathāsiddheḥ|
tasmātsvarūpamātre padānāṃ śaktirna saṃsarga iti sthitam|

etannirākartumanvitābhidhānapakṣaṃ pratijānīte---

padānāmeva yannāma saṃsṛṣṭasvārthabodhanam|
anvitasyābhidhānaṃ tat saṃgirante vipaścitaḥ|| 26

tatra pramāṇamāha---

pratipattuḥ pravṛttyā hi śabdavijñānabandhanā|
saṃsargabuddhirvyutpattrāvyavadhānānumīyate|| 27

pravṛttyanumite hi saṃsargajñāne śabdasāmarthyamanvayavyatirekau gamayataḥ|
nanu padārthabuddhivyavadhānenānyathāsiddhiruktā|
na tadānīṃ tāvadvyavadhānapratipattirna kālāntare tadanusāreṇaivāvāpoddhārasambhavāt|
na ca loke 'pi viśeṣaṇapratipattijanyā viśiṣṭapratipattiriti niyamaḥ pratipādakacakṣurādisāmye sati prathamata eva viśiṣṭapratipatteḥ|
tasmātprathamata evānvayavyatirekau saṃsargasāmarthyaṃ gamayata iti sthitam|

nanvevamapyāvāpoddhārābhyāṃ svarūpamātre sāmarthyamityuktamiti|
tatrāha---

yogyetarānvitasvārthasyāvāpoddhāradarśanāt|
saṃsṛṣṭeṣveva sāmarthyaṃ padānāmavasīyate|| 28

yadyapi pratiprayogaṃ viśeṣāntaratatsaṃsargayorvyabhicāro dṛśyate tathāpi yogyetarānvitasvārthasyāvyabhicārātprathamāvagatasaṃsargasāmarthyānusāreṇa tatraiva sāmarthyaṃ kalpyata ityabhiprāyaḥ|
na ca padārthajñānasyāvāpoddhārābhyāṃ saṃsargasyāvāpoddhārāviti yuktaṃ tasya saṃsargātpūrvabhāvitayā saṃsargeṇa tadānīmanvayavyatirekāyogācchabdasyeva tadānīṃ pūrvabhāvitvāsiddheḥ||

nanvarthāntaramātrānvitaṃ gotvaṃ na gośabdasāmarthyaviṣaya ānayanānvayasyāśābdatvaprasaṅgāt|
arthāntaramātrānvayasya ca svarūpamātrābhidhāne 'pyanumānādinaivānyathāsiddherna tatra śabdasāmarthyakalpanā yujyate|
athānayanaviśeṣānvitameva gotvaṃ gopadābhidheyaṃ kalpyeta tadānayatipadāntaravaiyarthyaprasaṅgaḥ|
tatrāha---

na sāmānyānvayaṃ brūmo viśeṣānvayameva tu|
arthe 'pi codanā tulyāpekṣā ca sahakāriṇī|| 29

yo hi gotvādipadārthā evākāṅkṣāsaṃnidhiyogyatāvaśena parasparātmasaṃsargaṃ pramimata iti pratijānīte tasyāpi padārthāḥ padārthāntaramātrasaṃsargaṃ na pratipādayanti viśeṣasaṃsarganiṣṭhatvātprayogapratyayayoranyathāsiddhatvācca sāmānyānvayasya|
atha padārthaviśeṣasaṃsṛṣṭasvātmānaṃ padārthaḥ pratipādayati tarhi padārthāntarāvagamāya na padāntaropādānamarthavadekenāpi padārthena viśiṣṭasaṃsargasiddheḥ|

atha saṃsargapratipādanasmārthā api padārthā na parasparamanapekṣya pratipādayanti śaktānāmapi kāryajanane sahakārisavyapekṣatvāditi|
śabdeṣvapi tarhi tulyo 'yaṃ nyāyasteṣāmapi saṃsargasamarthānāmanyonyāpekṣayā pratipādakatvāt|
ata eva satyapi gośabdasya yogyetarāśeṣapadārthaviśeṣasaṃsargapratipādanasāmarthye sahakārikāraṇasamavadhānabhedena kadācitkvacideva kāryahetutvamarthapakṣa iva na nirudhyate|

nanu yogyetarāśeṣaviśeṣasaṃsargābhidhānasamarthe gośabde prayukte kathamānayatinā tadapekṣito viśeṣaḥ samarpyata ānayaterapyanekaviśeṣasaṃsargasamarthatayā kvacideva niyamābhāvāt|
syādetat---prathamaprayukta eva śabdo 'nvitābhidhāne vartate caramaprayuktāstu svarūpābhidhānena tadarthaṃ niyamayantīti|
tanna śabdānāṃ prayoge prāthamyāniyamātsarveṣāmanvitābhidhānasāmarthyasyopagantavyatvānniyamāsiddheḥ|
athākhyātapadamevānvitamabhidhatte padāntarāṇi tu svarūpābhidhānena tadarthaṃ niyamayantīti|
tanna pramāṇābhāvādākhyātapadarahitavākye ca padārthānvayadarśanasyāpahnotumaśakyatvācca|
tasmānna parasparāpekṣayāpi saṃsarganiyamasiddhiriti tatrāha---

rūpamātre 'napekṣatvānniyamo na virudhyate|
arthe 'pi sāmyāccodyasya nātaḥ paryāyatā tayoḥ|| 30

satyapi saṃsargābhidhānasāmarthye gavādiśabdānāṃ gotvādisvarūpamātre sahakāryanapekṣayā buddhisāmarthyamastyekaikapadaprayoge tathādarśanāt|
na hi śakye 'pi sarvatra sahakāryapekṣaivānapekṣaiva veti niyantuṃ śakyata uccālanapaṭhanabhojanādiṣu loke kvacidapekṣā kvacidanapekṣetyubhayathādarśanāt|
ataḥ parasparānapekṣapadajanyabuddhigocarāneva padārthānitaretarasaṃsargitayā sambhūya padāni pramimata iti nāniyamaprasaṅgaḥ|

kiṃ ca padārthe 'pi kṛtsnaviśeṣasaṃsargabuddhisamarthe sahakāripadārthāntaramanekasaṃsargabuddhisamarthaṃ kena viśeṣeṇa saṃsargaṃ niyamayet|
athābhyarhitatvātsvarūpeṇaiva niyamayettarhi padamapi nirapekṣabuddhigocareṇa padārthasvarūpeṇa saṃsargaṃ niyamya pramimīta iti na kaścidvirodhaḥ|
ata evānapekṣabuddhigocaratvādgotvādayo gavādiśabdānāṃ svārthā iti viśeṣeṇocyante|

syādetat---gāmānayeti prayoge padayoritaretarasaṃsṛṣṭasvārthābhidhānātparyāyatvaprasaṅga iti|
naitatsāram---ekasmādeva hi padātsahakāripadāntaranirapekṣādyāvānarthaḥ pratīyate tāvāneva yadi padāntarādapi kevalātpratīyeta syāttayoḥ paryāyatvaṃ prasiddherna tatheha samasti parasparasāpekṣatvanimittaikakāryatvamātratvāt|

tasmānna padāntaravaiyarthyamaniyamo vā|

syādetat---pratiprayogaṃ saṃsargibhedādbhidyamāne saṃsarge śakyabhedādekasya gośabasyānantāḥ śaktayaḥ kalpayitavyāḥ prasajyeranniti|
tatrāha---

vicitrasahakāritvātkāryabhedasya siddhitaḥ|
śaktirna bhidyate 'rtheṣu tathā śabdeṣu cākṣavat|| 31

artho 'pi khalu saṃsargaṃ pratipādayanprativiśeṣaṃ saṃsargabhedādbhidyamānaśaktiḥ syāt|
atha sahakāripadārthavaicitryādekayāpi śaktyā kāryavaicitryaṃ sidhyati yathā cakṣuṣo nīlapītādiviṣayasahakāribhedādevaikayāpi rūpaprakāśanaśaktyā nīlapītādivijñānakāryabhedaḥ|
tarhi śabdeṣvapi sahakāribhedātkāryabhedo na daṇḍavāritaḥ||

nanu prativiśeṣamabhidheyabhedānantyātsambandhagrahaṇamaśakyasampādanam|
śakyasampādane ca śabdo 'nuvādaka eva syāt|
arthapakṣe tu na sambandhajñānāpekṣā śabdadharmatvādasyetyata āha---

upalakṣaṇayogena dhūmāgnyoriva saṃgateḥ|
vyutpattiyogo nātaḥ syātsaṃsargeṣvanuvādatā|| 32

yathaiva hi dhūmajātīyānāmagnijātīyairvyāptirityupalakṣaṇayogena viśeṣāṇāmapi sambandho gṛhyate tāvataiva viśiṣṭadeśeṣu dhūmaviśeṣadarśanāttathāvidhāgniviśeṣo 'pi gamyate na ca sāvagatiranuvāda evaṃ yogyetaratvopalakṣitaviśeṣasaṃsṛṣṭasvārthe sāmarthyamityupalakṣaṇopādānena kṛtsnasaṃsargasāmarthyapratipattāvapi na viśiṣṭasamabhivyāhārādviśiṣṭasaṃsargapratipattiranupapannā nāpi sā pratipattiranuvādaḥ|
vahnisāmānyamātravadanumāne padārthasvarūpamātraṃ śābde 'pi saṃsargo 'nūdyata evopalakṣaṇe 'pi svarūpamātrasya niyamena pramāṇāntarasiddhyapekṣaṇāt|
ataḥ saṃsarge nānuvāda iti siddham|

syādetat---yadi padāntareṇānabhihitena saṃsṛṣṭaṃ gotvaṃ gośabdenābhidhīyeta tadā padāntaravaiyarthyaṃ syāt|
athābhihitena tadetaretarāśrayatā---ānayane 'bhihite tadanvitaṃ gotvaṃ gośabdo 'bhidhatte gotve cābhihite tadanvitamānayanamānayatiriti| tatrāha---

krameṇāvagatānarthānyugapatsaṃhatānatha|
pramimīranpadānīti nānyonyāśrayadoṣatā|| 33

anyonyānapekṣameva padebhyaḥ padārthāḥ krameṇa pratīyante|
antyapadoccāraṇānantaraṃ ca tāneva padārthānitaretarasaṃsargitayā tānyeva pratipādayanti padānīti na doṣaḥ|
athavā nehānanvayipadārthāvagatiḥ pūrvabhāvinyapekṣyate kiṃ tvānuṣaṅgikī sā|
ato yugapatparāmṛṣṭāni padāni saṃsargaṃ pratipādayantītyabhidhīyamānenaivānvaya iti sthitam|

tasmātprayogasamaye 'nvayavyatirekābhyāṃ na svarūpamātre sāmarthyamavadhāritaṃ kiṃ tu samsarga iti sthitam|
yattvekaikasmātpadātpadārthamātramevāvasīyate na saṃsargo 'tastatraiva sāmarthyamiti tadapi na saṃsargasamarthasyaiva sahakārivikalasya svarūpamātre 'pi buddhihetutvopapatteranyathā padānāṃ padārtheṣu śaktayaḥ padārthānāṃ ca saṃsarge śaktaya iti śaktikalpanāgauravaṃ ca syāt|
syādetat---padapakṣe 'pi padārthāntaraviśiṣṭasvārthe sāmarthyamiti śakteḥ saviśeṣaṇatvaṃ prasajyata iti|
tanna---arthaśakterapyarthāntaravyāvṛttasvātmaviṣayatvena saviśeṣaṇatvāt|
ataḥ padārthasvarūpānuvādena saṃsargabuddhiḥ padebhya eveṣyatām|

atrāha kaścit---nābhidhānasāmarthyajanyo 'nuvādaḥ padātpadārthabuddhiḥ kiṃ tu smṛtipramāṇasaṃśayaviparyāsānāmanyatamena padātpadārthajñānena bhavitavye pariśeṣātsmṛtirevaiṣā|
sā ca pūrvopalambhasaṃskāranimittā nābhidhānamapekṣate|
śabdajñānaṃ cārthasambandhiśabdaviṣayatayā saṃskārodbodhadvāreṇa sambandhyantarasamṛtinimittamiti|
ko 'yaṃ padasya padārthena sambandhaḥ|
tadbuddhisāmarthyalakṣaṇa eva|
tata eva tarhi sāmarthyādbuddhiriṣyatāṃ kiṃ śaktisambandhini smṛtisāmarthyāntarakalpanayā|
naitatsāram|
viśiṣṭe 'rthe samarthasya svarūpamātre śaktyayogāttāvanmātre buddhyanupapatteriti|
tatrāha---

svarūpamātre 'śaktaṃ cetkathaṃ tatsmārakaṃ bhavet|
śaktyekadeśayogāccecchaktirevāstu bodhikā|| 34

viśiṣṭārthasambandhinaḥ śabdādekadeśasmṛtiriva tāvanmātre 'bhidhānakāryamapyupapadyata ityarthaḥ|
kiṃ ca---

niyamācchabdato buddhirna tathānvayidarśanāt|
artheṣu naiva śaktiḥ syātsaṃsarge 'pi ca tatsmṛteḥ|| 35

na tāvatsambandhidarśanātsambandhyantarabuddhirniyatādarśanādbahuvidhatvācca sambandhināṃ vaktrādīnāmekatra niyamena smṛtyayogāt|
sambandhagrahaṇasaṃskāravataśca śabdopalabdherniyamenārthabuddhirjāyate|
saṃskārajanyāyāṃ ca smṛtau śabdānvayavyatirekāvupekṣyeyātām|
na ca śabdasya smṛtihetusaṃskārodbodhakatayānyathāsiddhiḥ saṃskārodbodhasya smṛtivyatiriktasyānirūpaṇādvaktrādiviṣayasaṃskārodbodhaprasaṅgācca|
tasmātsambandhajñānasaṃskāraviśiṣṭamabhidhānameva padārthajñāneṣu puṣkalakāraṇamiti niyamenānuvāda evaiṣa jāyate|
pūrvopalambhataddeśakālādisambhedarahitatvācca na smṛtiḥ|

kiṃ ca saṃsargajñānasamaye 'pi padārthāṃśeṣu saṃskārāṇāṃ bhāvātsmṛtimātropapatterna kadācidapi teṣvabhidhānakāryaṃ sidhyet|
tataśca śaktisambandhājñānānna sambandhidarśanātsambandhyantarasmṛtiḥ|
na hi saṃsargajñānasamaye satsvapi saṃskāreṣvabhidhānajanitā padārthabuddhirna prāgiti niyantuṃ śakyate|
tasmādabhidhānajanyo 'yamanuvādaḥ|
sa eva caikaikasmātpadātprathamamutpadyate punastebhya evetaretarasahakāribhyaḥ saṃsargaḥ pratīyate śaktikalpanālāghavāditi sthitam|

api ca pramāṇāntarāvasitapadārthebhyaḥ saṃsarge 'pramīyamāṇe kathaṃ śabdopalabdhyanvayavyatirekavataḥ saṃsargapratyayasya padārthahetutvaṃ kalpyate|
syādetat---padārthānāṃ saṃsargavyāpāraṃ tacchaktiṃ vā padānyabhivyañjayanti na pramāṇāntaram|
tataśca saṃsargapratyayaḥ|
kiṃ ca sambandhajñānātprākpadānāmadṛśyamāne saṃsargahetutve kramavatpadārthāvagamātparācīnaḥ saṃsargapratyayaḥ kathaṃ śabdanibandhanaḥ syāditi|
tatrāha---

saṃsargaśakterna vyaktirvyāpārasyāpi śabdataḥ|
nābhidheyadvayaṃ taddhi na śabdaḥ kāraṇaṃ tayoḥ|| 36

na ca padasyābhidheyaviṣayaṃ vyāpārāntaramasti yena padārthāvagatau saṃsargaśaktitadvyāpārau vyajyeyātām|
na ca padebhyastayoḥ pratipattiranabhidheyatvāt|
na ca padajanyaṃ vijñānaṃ padārthātiśayaheturjñānasya svaviṣayavikārāhetutvāt|

na ca sambandhagrahaṇāpekṣayā saṃsargapratipādakeṣu padeṣvānuṣaṅgikapadārthapratipatteḥ saṃsargahetutvaṃ śakyate kalpayituṃ śaktikalpanāgauravādanyatrādṛṣṭasāmarthyatvācca|
na ca padārtheṣu padāvagateṣu kaścidatiśayo na mānāntarāvagateṣviti yuktam|
tasmātpadanibandhanaḥ saṃsargapratyayaḥ|

nanu

paśyataḥ śvetimārūpaṃ heṣāśabdaṃ ca śṛṇvataḥ|
khuraniṣpeṣaśabdaṃ ca śveto 'śvo dhāvatīti dhīḥ|| 

iti padārthebhyo 'pi saṃsargapratyayo darśita iti|
ata āha---

nārthādhīnastu saṃsargabodho mānāntaraṃ vinā|
pariśeṣānumānāddhi śveto 'śvo dhāvatīti dhīḥ|| 37

khuraniṣpeṣaśabdānumitasya dhāvanasya paridṛṣṭasya śvaityasya ca dharmyapekṣāyāṃ dravyāntarasyāsambhāvanātpariśeṣāddheṣāśabdānumitāśvadharminiṣṭhatāmanumimānaḥ śveto 'śvo dhāvatīti pratipadyate na padārthāntaramātrebhyaḥ|
kiṃ ca---

nāntargamaḥ pramāṇeṣu padārthānāmasambhavāt|
avinābhāvarūpāderna śābde tadalakṣaṇāt|| 38

na tāvaccakṣurādivatpadārthāḥ saṃsargamavagamayantyanavabuddhānāmahetutvāt|
nāpyanumānavadavinābhāvābhāvāt|
nāpyarthāpattyā saṃsargamantareṇāpi padārthopapatteḥ|
sādṛśyābhāvau ca niyataviṣayau|
na ca śābde 'ntarbhāvaḥ śabdādarthe buddhiriti lakṣaṇāt|

nanu śabdāvabuddhapadārthajanyo 'pi saṃsargabodhaḥ śābda eva|
nārthānāṃ saṃsargeṇa sambandhābhāvādbodhakatvānupapatteḥ|
nanvāśrayāśrayilakṣaṇaḥ sambandho vidyate|
na tāvanmātrasyābuddhinimittatvāt|
na hi śabdapratipanne 'pi ghaṭe tadāśrayo rasaḥ pratīyate 'vinābhāvādivyatirekeṇa|
nanu śabdā eva saṃsargaṃ bodhayanti kiṃ tu padārthabuddhivyavadhānena|
taduktam---

vākyārthamitaye teṣāṃ prayuktau nāntarīyakam|
pāke jvāleva kāṣṭhānāṃ padārthapratipādanam||

iti|
naitatsāraṃ padānāṃ padārthabuddhiṣu paryavasānājjvālānāmiva pākasya padārthānāṃ saṃsargasyānimittatvāt|
atha śabdā eva padārthabuddhyupakaraṇāḥ saṃsargamavagamayeyuḥ|
kimupakaraṇairgṛhītasambandhānāmeva śabdānāmanvayavyatirekavattvāt|
tasmānna padārthebhyaḥ saṃsargapratyayaḥ pramāṇapakṣapātī|

kathaṃ punaranvitābhidhāne lakṣaṇāvṛttiryāvatā na mukhyamarthamarthāntarasaṃsargitayā pratipādayati|
nāpi lakṣyamāṇaṃ tadabhidhāyakapadābhāvāt|
ato lakṣyamāṇārthanibandhanastatra saṃsargaḥ|
adhyāhāre cādhyāhriyamāṇārthanibandhana eva saṃsargastadabhidhāyakapadābhāvāditi|
tatrāha---

lakṣaṇāyāṃ ca tadvācipadātsaṃsargadhīrbhavet|
adhyāhāre ca śabdārthāpattilabdhātpadāddhi sā|| 39

mañcaśabdaḥ krośanena saṃsṛṣṭasvārthaṃ pratipādayituṃ pravṛttastatra virodhātkrośanasaṃsargitayā svārthabuddhidvāreṇa puruṣe buddhimutpādayati|
krośanasaṃsargitayā śabdātpratipanno hi mañcapadārthaḥ puruṣe krośanasaṃsargiṇi buddhiheturna kevala iti|
ataḥ saṃnihitapadābhidheyārthasaṃsargipadārthapratipādanāya pravṛttaṃ padaṃ vyavadhānenāvyavadhānena vā yatrākāṅkṣitārthapratipattihetustatsaṃsargastannibandhana iti nānvitābhidhānapakṣasvīkāravirodhaḥ|

vyaktilakṣaṇāyāmapi sāmānyabuddheravyabhicāreṇa vyaktau paryavasānāttatsāmānyasaṃsargābhidhānameva viśeṣasaṃsarge 'pi nimittam|
arthavādināṃ cābhihitānāmasaṃsargādanvayināṃ cānabhidheyatvātsadvāraṃ pratipādakatvamaviśiṣṭam|

adhyāhāre ca prameyaikadeśasamarpaṇasamarthapramāṇaikadeśaviṣayaśabdārthāpattiprāpitapadopasaṃhāreṇānvitābhidhānasiddhiḥ|
anyathādhyāhriyamāṇārthasaṃsargasyārthanibandhanatvenānāgamikatvaprasaṅgāt|
tasmādupasaṃharati---

ataḥ padebhyaḥ saṃsargastacchaktibhyaḥ pramīyate|
iti nyāyairyathāśakti vyutpattiṃ pratyapīpadam|| 40

uktamanvitābhidhānātpadebhya eva varṇātmakebhyaḥ saṃsargabuddhiriti|
api ca---

śābdatvaṃ nānyathaiva syātpadavṛndasmṛtervinā|
mahāvākye na cette 'pi nirvikalpetarā hi sā|| 41

ito 'pi varṇātmakānāmeva padānāṃ vākyārthapratipādakatvamaṅgīkartavyamanyathā tasya śābdatvavirahādaprāmāṇyaprasaṅgāt|
ye tu manyante varṇopalambhajanitāḥ saṃskārā eva smārakāstadatirekiṇo vā padārthabuddhisāmarthyāvacchinatayā padaśabdabhāginaḥ saṃsargaṃ pratipādayantīti tairapi saṃsargasya śābdatvamabhipretamātmīyena matena nirākṛtaṃ bhavati|
kathaṃ hi śabdopalabdhapadārthajanitasaṃsargabodhamaśābdaṃ bruvatā tadupalambhajanitasaṃskārajanitasaṃsargabodhasya śābdatvamiṣyate|
na hi cākṣuṣajñānasaṃskārajanitaṃ jñānaṃ cākṣuṣaṃ pramāṇaṃ vā bhavati|
anadhigatārthaviṣayatābhāvāditi cet---itaratrāpi saṃskārajanyatve tathātvaṃ kena vāryate|

tatrāha---varṇapakṣe 'ntyapadapratyayānantarāśeṣapadāvamarśismṛtijñānaṃ saṃsarganimittaṃ mahāvākye 'śakyasampādanamiti jñānānapekṣāḥ saṃskārā eva taddhetava iti|
naitatsāram|
mahāvākye na śābdī pramitiḥ kiṃ tvavagatasaṃsargāṇāmekaprayojanasambandhitayānvayo 'rthanibandhana eva|
yatra padaikavākyatā tatraiva śābdī pramitiḥ|
tatra cālpatvātpadānāṃ nānusaṃdhānānupapattiḥ|

itarasyāpi saṃsargapramiteḥ savikalpakatvāttadvācakāśeṣapadānuṣaṅgo na śakyate nirākartum|
aśeṣapadāvamarśasiddhaye ca vākyaṃ punaḥ punaḥ paṭhyate|
saṃskārapakṣe teṣāṃ sakṛdutpatterna punaḥ punaḥ paṭhanāpekṣā|
kramopalabdhāśeṣapadāvamarśismṛtyudaye ca saṃskārapracayāpekṣā loke 'nvayavyatirekasamadhigatā|
ananvayipadāvyavahitamekamidaṃ vākyamiti samastapadānavamarśe nopapadyate|
saṃsargapratyayānyathānupapattyā vā samastapadāvamarśaḥ kalpyatām|
sambandhagrahaṇe ca samastapadāvamarśābhāve na saṃsargasāmarthyapratipattiḥ|
tasmātpadavṛndasmṛtereva saṃsargapratipattiḥ|

yo 'pyantyapadārthāvagamānantaramaśeṣapadārthāvamarśaṃ saṃsargahetuṃ kalpayati tasyāpi savikalpakatayā padārthāvamarśasya tadvācakāśeṣapadāvamarśe vaktavye kimubhayānusmaraṇena kalpitena|
tasmātsamastapadāvamarśādeva saṃsarga iti sthitam||

uktamanvitābhidhānam|
idānīṃ tatraiva kaṃcidviśeṣaṃ parāmṛśati---

kiṃ kāryānvayinaṃ svārthaṃ kiṃ vārthāntarasaṃgatam|
śabdo 'bhidhatta ityetadadhunā saṃvimṛśyate|| 42

tatra kāryānvayavādī svapakṣaṃ varṇayati---

pratipattuḥ pravṛttyā hi śabdavijñānabandhanā|
kāryasaṃsargadhīreva vyutpattrādhyavasīyate|| 43

pratipattuḥ pravṛttiliṅgena viśiṣṭakāryajñānamanumāya tadanvayiṣu padārtheṣu padānāṃ sāmarthyamavadhārayati|
nanu bālena yatsvātmani pravṛttinimittamavagataṃ tadeva pratipatturapyanumīyate|
tarhi hitajñānaṃ tatsādhanajñānaṃ vā praiṣādirveṅgitādirvā darśitaṃ pravṛttinimittamityata āha---

na pravṛttirhitopāyāttatheṣṭādāśayācca naḥ|
vyabhicārādabādhācca kāryabuddheḥ phalādiṣu|| 44

avadhārite ca phale tatsādhane ca nātītādirūpe pravartate|
ato hitādayo 'pi kālatrayaviviktatayā kāryabuddhigamyaḥ pravṛttihetavaḥ|
tatra vyabhicārāddhitādīnāmavyabhicārācca kāryabuddheḥ saiva pravṛttiheturiti|

nanu tadeva hi kāryaṃ yadiṣṭasādhanam|
taduktam---karturiṣṭābhyupāye hi kartavyamiti lokadhīḥ|
iti|
athavā hitasādhanajñānādhīnatvātkartavyatābuddhestadeva kāryatābuddhidvāreṇa pravṛttinimittamiti tatraiva śabdasāmarthyaṃ kalpyata ityata āha---

kāryaṃ neṣṭābhyupāyatvaṃ kṛtivyāpyaṃ hi tatsmṛtam|
tadevāvyavadhānāttatsiddhatve 'pi pravartakam|| 45

prasiddhastāvatkāryeṣṭasādhanayorbhedaḥ|
iṣṭasādhanajñānādhīnamapi kāryatājñānamavyavadhānātpravṛttinimittamucyate|
na hyanvayavyatirekādhīnaṃ hitasādhanamityanvayavyatirekau pravṛttinimittam|
tasmātkāryameva pravṛttiheturiti sthitam|

tatra kecidāhuḥ ---śābdavyavahāre śabdabhāvanā pravṛttiheturiti|
tatrābhūtaprādurbhāvaphalaṃ karotyarthamātraṃ bhāvanā|
tatrārthavyāpāro 'rthabhāvanā śabdavyāpārastu svābhidheyajñānajananalakṣaṇaḥ śabdabhāvanā|
sā ca śabdakartṛkārthajñānabhāvyaniṣṭhā śabdajñānakaraṇikā sambandhajñānasaṃskāretikartavyatākā ca sarvaśabdānāmaviśeṣavatī|
liṅgādiśabde tu bhidyate|
sā hi liṅgādikartṛkārthabhāvanālakṣaṇapuruṣapravṛttibhāvyaniṣṭhā svajñānakaraṇikā stutinindārthavādādijñānetikartavyatākā ca samāśrīyate|

katham| pākaṃ karotīti pacatītyākhyātārthasya karotinā vyākhyānātsarvākhyātānāṃ tāvatkarotyartho 'bhidheyaḥ|
liṅādīnāṃ tu vidhivivakṣayā prayujyamānānāṃ cetanaviṣayapravṛttiyogitvātpuruṣaprayatnaḥ puruṣārthabhāvyaniṣṭho dhātvarthakaraṇaḥ prayājādītikartavyatāko 'rthabhāvanālakṣaṇaḥ karotyartho 'bhidheyaḥ|
tatra svābhidheyārthabhāvanājñānajanano liṅādiśabdavyāpāraḥ svābhidheyārthabhāvanāmapi bhāvayatīti viśeṣaḥ|

katham| 
liṅādiśabdaśravaṇānantaraṃ pravṛttidarśanācchabdamātrasyāgṛhītasambandhasyāpravartakatvātpravṛttihetuṃ kaṃcidarthamabhidhāya śabdaḥ pravartayatīti gamyate|
tatrārthāntarābhidhānakalpanāyāṃ kalpanāgauravātsvābhidhānavyāpāramabhidheyajñānajananalakṣaṇamabhidhāya taddvāreṇārthabhāvanāṃ pravṛttiṃ janayatīti pariśeṣārthāpattibhyāṃ kalpyate|
tataścārthabhāvanābhāvyaniṣṭhā śabdabhāvanā na kevalaṃ tajjñānabhāvyaniṣṭhā|
abhidhānajanyaṃ śabdabhāvanāviṣayaṃ vijñānaṃ pravartakajñānatvātpravṛttilakṣaṇabhāvyaniṣpādanadvāreṇa śabdabhāvanāṃ prati karaṇatāmaśnute|
aṃśatrayasahitārthabhāvanāviṣayastutinindārthavādādijñānamapi prarocanādvāreṇa pravṛttihetutvācchabdabhāvanāṃ pratītikartavyatāmanubhavati|
tadevamaṃśatrayasahitā śabdabhāvanā śābdavyavahāre pravṛttiheturiti sthitam|
etannirācaṣṭe---

pravṛttiheturdṛṣṭānte na dṛṣṭā śabdabhāvanā|
lokasiddhe 'pi śabdārthe nārthāpattiśca gauravāt|| 46

na tāvadiyaṃ śabdabhāvanā bālena pravṛttihetutayā svātmani samadhigatā yena pratipatturapi śabdārthatayānumīyeta|
na ca pariśeṣārthāpattibhyāṃ svābhidheyābhidhānamavagamyate lokasiddhakāryānumānenaivānyathāsiddherekasya śabdasya śabdārthabhāvanābhidheyadvayakalpanāgauravācca|
abhidheyajñānagamye cābhidhānavyāpāre na tatra śabdasāmarthyakalpanānyathāsiddhatvāttajjñānasya|
na ca yugapadekasmācchabdādabhidheyadvayaviṣayajñānadvayotpādaḥ kartṛsaṃkhyārthabhāvanayoriva śabdārthabhāvanayorekavākyatābhāvāt|
na ca krameṇa śabdasya viramya vyāpārābhāvāt|
tasmātsvarūpānupapatterapravartakatvācca tasyāḥ kāryameva pravṛttiheturiti sthitam|

atrocyate---

anvayavyatirekābhyāmupadeśādibhūmiṣu|
vyutpadyante 'nyasaṃsṛṣṭe bālāḥ kāryānvite na tu|| 47

na ca śabdasamanantarajanyapravṛttiliṅgānumānaikopāyaiva śabdārthasambandhāvagatiḥ kiṃ tūpadeśopāyāpi|
tathā hi bālebhyo jananyādibhiḥ prāyeṇopadiśyante śabdārthasambandhāḥ|
te ca tatra prayogapratyayayorivānvayavyatirekābhyāṃ viśeṣasambandhamavadhārayanti|

nanvayaṃ ghaṭo 'yaṃ paṭa ityādyupadeśo 'pi prayogamūla eva prayoge ca kāryānvite saṃgatigrahastenopadeśo 'pi kāryaniṣṭha iti|
tanna|
prayogasyāpyupadeśamūlatvasambhavānnedaṃprathamatā tayoḥ parasparamūlatopapatteḥ|
na ca prayoge kāryaniṣṭhatetyupadeśe 'pi tanniṣṭhatāvagamā vyutpattuḥ śabdasāmarthyaviṣayatayā kāryasyāpratīterupadeśe 'nyasaṃsargamātrapratīteḥ|
upadeśe 'pratīyamānakāryakalpanādvaraṃ prayoge 'pi saṃsṛṣṭamātrasya pratīyamānasyābhidheyatvakalpanam|

nanūpadeśe buddhisāmarthyaṃ śabdasya pratipattuṃ na śakyate prayoga iva buddhikāryāvagame mānābhāvāt|
kathaṃ tarhyupadeśānantaraṃ prayuktācchabdādarthaṃ pratipadyante bālāḥ|
kvacitprayoge śabdasya buddhisamarthatāvagamādihāpi tatsāmānyādbuddhisāmarthyapratipattiriti cet---tathāpyupadeśeṣu kāryamantareṇa buddhisāmarthyasiddhiḥ|
tathā ca rāgaśaktīcchādveṣādiviṣayāḥ śabdārthasambandhāḥ prāyeṇa vyutpādyante teṣāṃ prayogasamavāyipravṛttiviṣayatvadarśanāyogāt|
tathā ca devadattaḥ kāṣṭhaiḥ sthālyāmodanaṃ pacatītyādiṣvatītānāgatavartamānārthaniṣṭheṣvapi vākyeṣu prasiddhārthapadasamabhivyāhāreṇāprasiddhārthasyāpi padasya sambandho 'vagamyate|
tathā nigamaniruktanighaṇṭuvyākaraṇebhyo 'pi sphuṭatarā śabdārthavyutpattirna caiteṣu kāryārthatāvagamo 'pratīteḥ|

kathaṃ punarupadeśsādiṣu saṃsṛṣṭasvārthe sāmarthyāvagamaḥ|
vākyarūpatvādupadeśādīnāṃ padāntarābhidheyapadārthasaṃsṛṣṭasvārthasya sarvatrāvyabhicārāttathāgṛhītasambandhādapi śabdātsaṃsṛṣṭārthāvagamāt|
tasmānna kāryasaṃsṛṣṭe niyamena sāmarthyasiddhiḥ|
kiṃ ca---

kāryānvite ca śabdārthe pratyekaṃ saṃgatigrahāt|
śābdapramāṇahāniḥ syānnādṛṣṭe saṃgatigrahaḥ|| 48

yajeta svargakāma iti śrautādvākyānnāpūrvārthapramitilābho yato niyojyaviṣayābhidhāyinoḥ padayoḥ sambandhajñānakāle kāryasaṃsṛṣṭo niyojyo viṣayaśca siddhaḥ|
tatra viṣayaniyojyavyāvṛtte niyoge śabdo 'nuvādaḥ syāt|
na hi viṣayaniyojyasambandhaḥ śābdaḥ kiṃ tvarthanibandhanaḥ|
anyānvite tūpalakṣaṇopādānena dhūmādagnijñānavadapūrvārthapramitiryujyate|

syādetat---anavagatasyaiva kāryasya sambandhajñānaviṣayatvānna viṣayaniyojyavyāvṛtte kārye śabdo 'nuvāda iti|
naitatsāraṃ yato 'navagate kārye tatsaṃsṛṣṭapadārthāntarānavagamādagṛhītasambandhā eva sarve śabdā bodhayeyuriti prasajyeta|
yato nānavagate 'rthe sambandhajñānam|
athājñādiṣūpādhiṣu kāryo 'pyarthaḥ pratibimbito 'vagamyata iti|
tathāpi tatsvarūpasaṃsṛṣṭeṣu sarvapadārtheṣu sambandhajñānāya pramāṇāntarādhigateṣu siddhaṃ śabdānāmanuvādakatvam|
atha pravartakatvaṃ pramāṇāntaragṛhītatayā śabdārthaḥ pravartakaviśeṣastu viṣayaniyojyavyāvṛtto niyogaḥ pramīyata iti tathāpi śābdaḥ saṃsargo 'nuvādo viśeṣastu pariśeṣānumānagocara iti nāpūrvārthapramitilābhaḥ|
tasmādupalakṣaṇopādānenānyānvite sambandhagrahe 'pūrvārthasiddhiḥ|
kiṃ ca---

saṃsargapratiyogitvaṃ nānumeyasya kṛtsnataḥ|
pratipattyantare mā bhūdupāyatvaṃ samaṃ tayoḥ|| 49

yadi pravṛttyunnīyamānapratyayaviṣayaśabdasāmarthyapratipattāvanugamyamānaṃ kāryamapi sarvaśabdasāmarthyaviṣayaniyāmakatvena prayojakaṃ kalpyeta tarhi satyeva pramāṇāntaramitatvādau prayogapratyayābhyāṃ sambandhajñānādasati cājñānāttasyāpi sarvaśabdasāmarthyaviṣayaniyāmakatvaṃ syāt|

nanu pravṛttyā pravartakajñānamanumāya tatraiva śabdasāmarthyaṃ pratipadyate kutaḥ pramāṇāntarameyatvādeḥ prayojakatvāvakāśaḥ|
satyam---asminprayoge tathāstu kiṃ tu prayogāntareṣu bhinnasaṃsargeṣvanuvartamānaṃ prayojakaṃ mṛgyate|
nanu kāryaṃ sarvatrānuvartate|
satyaṃ pramāṇāntarameyatvāderapyastvanuvṛttiranvayavyatirekaniyamāt|
nanu pramāṇāntarameyatvādiḥ śabdasāmarthyaviṣayo na bhavatīti prāgeva varṇitam|
tarhi pramāṇāntaramitatvādyupalakṣitakāryasaṃsṛṣṭasvārthe sāmarthyamiti kalpyatām|

nanu śabdasāmarthyaviṣayatve sati yadanuvartamānaṃ tadeva prayojakam|
tanna| evaṃviśeṣaṇādvaramanuvartamānaṃ prayojakamiti grahaṇam|
nanu mānāntarapramitatvādyupalakṣitakāryānvita iti grahaṇādvaraṃ kāryānvita iti grahaṇam|
satyaṃ tato 'pi laghīyo 'nvita sāmarthyamiti grahaṇam|

nanu pramāṇāntaramitatvāderanvayavyatirekau tasya sambandhagrahaṇopāyatvenānyathāsiddhāvavagamya vivakṣitvā prayukte śabde pravṛttyā cānumite vākyārthajñāne sambandhāvagamādanyathā cānavagamāt|
ato na tasya sarvaśabdasāmarthyaviṣayaniyāmakatvamanvayavyatirekau gamayataḥ|
evaṃ tarhi satyeva kāryajñāne pravṛttisiddhyā vākyārthajñānamanumāya tatra sāmarthyajñānādanyathā cājñānāttadanvayavyatirekāvanyathāsiddhau na tasya sarvaśabdasāmarthyaviṣayaniyāmakatvaṃ gamayataḥ|
tasmādanyānvite sāmarthyam|

nanu yadi kāryatāderanvayavyatirekavato 'pi sarvaśabdasāmarthyaviṣayaniyāmakatvaṃ parityajyopāyatayānyathāsiddhirucyate---ucyatāṃ tarhi saṃsargasyāpi śabdasāmarthyaviṣayatābhāvaḥ|
naitatsāram|
padavyatiriktaṃ vākyaṃ padapratibuddhapadārthānvā saṃsargahetūnavalambya tatpratyayasyānyathāsiddhirvaktavyā|
tayośca pakṣayoḥ śaktikalpanāgauravātpadārthānāṃ ca pramāṇapakṣasaṃgamābhāvāditi varṇitadoṣatvācchabdanibandhana eva saṃsargapratyaya iti kalpyate|
kiṃ ca---

kāryānvite ca śabdārthe kāryaṃ kenānvitaṃ bhavet|
guṇadravyādiśabdānāṃ sākṣātkāryeṇa nānvayaḥ|| 50

kāryapadavyatiriktānāṃ kāryānvite sāmarthyaṃ kāryapadasya tu svarūpe 'nyānvite veti dvairūpyaparihārāyānyānvite sāmarthyamityekameva prayojakamupādeyaṃ kāryasya kāryāntarābhāvāt|

yo 'pi kāryānvayānvite sāmarthyamiti bakabandhamiva prayojakamāha tasyāpi bahuviśeṣaṇaṃ prayojakamiti doṣaḥ|
yo 'pi yogyetarānvite sāmarthyamaṅgīkṛtya kāryārthenaivetareṣāmanvayayogyatā kāryasya cetarairiti yogyatāṃ niyamayati tenāpi guṇadravyakārakatvādīnāṃ parasparānvayayogyatā pratyakṣāvatā na nirākartavyā|
satyamārthī sā yogyatā śābdī tu kāryetarapadārthānāmeveti cet---na kāryapadārthena guṇadravyakārakatvādīnāṃ sākṣādanvayāyogyatvāt|
bhāvārthena hi kāryasyānvayaḥ kārakaṃ tu bhāvārthasyeti niyamāt|

atha kāryeṇa sarvapadārthānāṃ śeṣaśeṣitālakṣaṇo 'nvayo 'vyavahitaḥ kriyākārakalakṣaṇastu vyavahita iti matam|
keyaṃ śeṣaśeṣitā---na tāvadbhṛtyasvāmitā cetanaviṣayatvāt|
tadupādhikartavyatā taccheṣteti cet---na jātiguṇadravyāṇāṃ kartavyatāyogātsiddharūpatvāt|
na ca guṇaguṇyādivadāśrayāśrayibhāvaḥ śeṣaśeṣitā|
athopakāryopakārakatā|
bhāvārtha eva tarhītarapadārthānāṃ śeṣī|
garbhadāso 'pi svāminopakriyamāṇaḥ śeśī bhṛtyatvena tu sambandhāntareṇa guṇabhūtaḥ|
atha prādhānyaṃ śeṣitā|
kiṃ śabdato 'rthato vā|
śabdataścet---dadhna eva prādhānyāttadanvitahomakartavyatāyāṃ śabdasambandhaḥ syāt|
arthataścedacetanasyopakāryataiva prādhānyaṃ taccāvyavadhānena bhāvārthasya vyavadhānena sukhasya duḥkhanivṛtterveti na kāryānvayayogyatāniyamaḥ|
ato yathāpramāṇāntarasiddhayogyatānusārameva padānāṃ yogyānvite sāmarthyamiti ramaṇīyam|
kiṃ ca---

bhūtārthabuddhirnāmānaṃ nādhyāhāro na cānumā|
kalpanāgauravātkāryadṛṣṭyā tacchaktiriṣyatām|| 51

na tāvallaukikī bhūtārthabuddhiḥ śabdanibandhanā na pramāṇaṃ pratyakṣādiva śabdādbhūtārthaṃ pratipadya pramāṇāntareṇopakārāpakārahetutāṃ cānusmṛtyārthāvisaṃvādivyavahārāt|

atha tatrāpi kāryamadhyāhriyate|
na tāvadarthasamavāyinaḥ kāryasyādhyāhāraḥ pratipattustatra pravṛttinivṛttyorabhiprāyāparijñānāt|
nāpi jñātavya ityadhyāhāro yato devadatto nirgata iti jñātavya ityatra devadattanirgamanapadārthasvarūpe tatsaṃsarge vā padābhyāmeva jñānotpattau niṣpannaviṣayakāryāyogānna yogyatālakṣaṇaḥ padasamanvayaḥ syāt|
anutpanne tu vihite ca jñāne na devadattanirgamanajñānotpādaḥ padayostatrānutpādakatvādvidhipadasya ca devadattanirgamanajñānakartavyatāyāṃ jñānahetutvādvidheyasya ca jñānasya vidhiviṣayajñānasya ca bhinnatvāt|
tasmājjñātavya ityadhyāhāre bhūtapramitilopaḥ prasajyeta|
kiṃ ca sambandhajñāne kāryamityadhikaṃ prayojakaṃ kalpayitvā loke 'pi prativākyamapratītasya padasyādhyākārakalpanādvaramanvite sāmarthyakalpanam||

atha laukikī bhūtārthapramitirna śābdī kiṃ tvanumānanibandhaneti|
na tatrāpyanvayavyatirekavacchabdaparityāge kalpanāgauravāt|
na ca kāryasaṃsṛṣṭasamarthebhyaḥ śabdebhyo bhūtārthasaṃsargānumānasiddhiḥ|
na cāsau saṃsargabhramaḥ pratyakṣavadvyavahārāvisaṃvādādabādhāt|

anyānvite ca śabdakāryadarśanāttāvanmātre sāmarthyaṃ kalpyate kāryagamyatvātsāmarthyasya|
nanu tāvanmātre śaktigrahaṇābhāve kathaṃ tatra kāryadarśanam|
naiṣa doṣo 'nyānvitatvamapi sambandhajñānasamaye kāryānvayāntarvartitayā vartate|
kāryadarśanāttu tāvanmātre sāmarthyaṃ niyamyate|
nanvanavadhārite prayojake kathaṃ kāryotpādaḥ|
na prayojakāntaraṃ kalpayato 'pi kāryavākyādbuddhikāryadarśanāt|
sambandhajñānasamaye kāryasyāpi vidyamānatvādbuddhikāryopapattiranyānvitapakṣe 'pi samānā|
tasmānna kāryānvite sāmarthyaṃ kiṃ tvanyānvita iti siddham|

aṅgīkṛtya liṅgādiśabdānāṃ kāryābhidhāyitvaṃ prayojakopādānasāmarthyādanyānvite sāmarthyamityuktam|
idānīṃ tadeva nāstīti pratipādayitumāha---

viśiṣṭavyavahārasya heturnānyo nidarśane|
iṣṭābhyupāyātkāryatvaṃ hyanyathāsiddhabodhanam|| 52

vyutpitsamānena yatsvātmani pravṛttinimittaṃ samadhigataṃ tadeva pratipatturapi pravṛttinimittamanumīyate|
tacca neṣṭasādhanajñānādanyatsamadhigatam|

nanu phalajñānādapi pravartate|
satyam| icchālakṣaṇaiva tannimittā pravṛttirna viśiṣṭasvarūpā śarīrādivyāpārātmikā|
sā hi pravartakānumānabījaṃ pareṣāmupalabdhigocaravāt|
sā cetthaṃbhūtābhilaṣitasādhanajñānanimittaiva|
kadācitsādhanasāmānyajñānāttadviśeṣajijñāsayā pravartamāno 'pi tata eva pravartate na phalamātrajñānāt|

nanviṣṭasādhanamapyatītādibhāvena gamyamānaṃ na pravartayati|
satyam| tasya kālasambandhajñānaṃ pravṛttipratibandhakam|
nanu siddhe hetutve pratibandhakalpanā|
satyam| kālasambandhajñānavikale karturabhilaṣitasādhane 'vagate pravṛtteranavagate ca tasminnapravṛtteranvayavyatirekajñānadvayānupapattiprabhavayārthāpattyādhigatameva tasya pravṛttihetutvam|
nanu satyapi tasminnaśakto na pravartate|
satyam| kartṛsāmarthyādisādhanapauṣkalye sati yato viṣayaviśeṣajñānātpravartate tadeva pravṛttihetutayā śabdābhidheyamiti kāryavādināpyaṅgīkartavyaṃ tatraiva śabdasāpekṣatāniyamāt|

nanvevamapi karturabhilaṣitasya sādhanaṃ kālaviviktaṃ kṛtiyogyatayā kāryamavagamyamānaṃ pravartayatītyuktaṃ bhavati|
tatra kāryataiva pravṛttihetuḥ kiṃ na syāt|
phale pravṛttivyabhicārāditi vadāmaḥ|
tadapi hi sukhaṃ duḥkhanivṛttirvā sākṣādvyavadhānena vā kṛtiyogyatayā kāryamityavagamyate|
na tatra viśiṣṭapravṛttiricchālakṣaṇaivetyuktam|
tarhi hitasādhanagataṃ kāryatvameva pravṛttihetuḥ|
tanna viśeṣaṇāyogāt|

nanu hitasādhanamapyatīdādau na pravartayatīti kṛtiyogyatāpyavaśyāpekṣaṇīyā|
na pariniṣpannapadārthāṃśajñānasyāpi sākṣādvā paramparayā vābhilaṣitasādhanaviṣayasya padārthāṃśe pravṛttihetutvātkiṃ tu kāraṇasāmarthyavadviṣayasya kṛtiyogyatāpi pravṛttāvupasarjanatvenāpekṣyate|
prādhānyaṃ tu hitasādhanasyaiva satyapi kṛtiyogyatve hitasādhanatābhāve viśiṣṭapravṛttyadarśanāt|
nanu kāryasyāpyanvayavyatirekayostulyatvātkāryameva pradhānamiti kiṃ na bhavet|
na kālopabandhalakṣaṇapratibandhanirāsakatvenāpi kṛtiyogyatayānvayavyatirekayoranyathāsiddhyupapatteḥ|
nanu pratibandhanirāsakalpanādvaraṃ hetutvakalpanam|
tanna|
sati hyekasminkāraṇe 'nanyathāsiddhānvayavyatirekābhyāṃ kāraṇāntaraṃ kalpyate|
tau cānyathāsiddhāvityuktam|

nanu kālopabandhaḥ pratibandhaḥ kiṃ vā kāraṇābhāvaḥ|
pratibandha eva k.lptakāraṇe hitasādhanatve tatrāpi vidyamāne pravṛttikāryavirodhitvādak.lptatvācca kāryatāyāḥ|
nanvevaṃ sarvatra sahakārikār'nopādānalopaḥ syāt|
na syāt| yatra kāryavirodhibhāvāntaravyudāsena yasyānvayastatra pratibandhanirāsenaiva tasyānvayaḥ|
yatra tu svābhāvamātravyudāsenānvayavyatirekābhyāṃ yasya kāryānvayastasya tatra kāraṇatvenaivānvayaḥ|
iha tu kālopabandhajñānaṃ pravṛttivirodhi bhāvāntaram|
tacca vyudasyate kāryatājñānena|
na ca kulālādervirodhipiṇḍāntaranirāsenaivānvayaḥ kiṃ tu kāraṇatvenaiva kvacinnivṛtte 'pi tasminghaṭānutpatteḥ|
iha tu hitasādhanajñānaṃ kālaviviktaṃ sati kāraṇasāmarthye pravṛttiṃ prasūta eva|

nanu kāryataiva pravṛttihetustasyāḥ phaloparāgaḥ pravṛttipratibandhakastannirāso 'bhimatasādhanateti kiṃ na kalpyate|
duḥkhatatsādhanayoḥ kṛtyā niṣpattiyogyayorapi hitasādhanatābhāve pravṛttyadarśanāt|
atha tayorapi pravṛttipratibandhakatā|
nobhayaśūnye 'pi vastumātre niṣpādanayogye 'pi pravṛttyadarśanāt|
atha tadapi pravṛttiviṣayatayā kiṃcidduḥkhakaratvātpravṛttipratibandhakam|
na tasminnevābhilaṣitasādhanabhāve 'vagate paścātpravṛtteḥ|

atha sarvatra hitasādhanatābhāvajñānaṃ pravṛttipratibandhakam|
na yogyānupalabdhyabhāve 'bhāvaniścayābhāvānniṣpādanayogye vastumātrasvarūpe pravṛttiḥ syāt|

atha na niṣpādanayogyatā kāryatā kiṃ tu buddhipūrvakāriṇaḥ kṛtyupakṣepayogyatā|
sā ca hite tatsādhane vā nānyatra|
ataḥ phalameva pravṛttipratibandhakaṃ tatsādhanatā tu tannirāsa iti|
tarhi buddhipūrvakāriṇaḥ kṛtyupakṣepayogyatā viṣayasamavāyinī niṣpādanayogyatāmātravyatiriktābhilaṣitatā tatsādhanatā vā nānyadanirūpaṇāt|
pravṛttyabhāvavirodhiteti cet---na pravṛttereva pravartakatvaprasaṅgāt|
pravartakatve sati pravṛttyabhāvavirodhiteti cet---rāga eva tarhi sā kartavyatā tu viṣayasamavāyinīti|
hitādireva vā pravṛttyabhāvavirodhī| 
tatra hitasya viśiṣṭapravṛttihetutvābhāvāddhitasādhanameva pravṛttihetuḥ śabdāntareṇābhidhīyata iti na pakṣāntarametat|
vayaṃ tu hitasādhanasyaiva niṣpādanayogyatā pravṛttau pratibandhanirāsenopakaraṇatvena vāpekṣyata ityetāvadbrūmaḥ|

nanu sādhanasādhane 'pi tadviṣayajñānātpravartate|
satyam| sādhanasya paramparayā hitatvamaṅgīkṛtya tatsādhane 'pi tataḥ pravartate|
tadecchālakṣaṇaiva sākṣātsādhane pravṛttirviśiṣṭā tu punaḥ sādhanasādhane|
evaṃ ca sati prayājādyaṅgavidhayaḥ kratoreva hitatvamaṅgīkṛtya tatsādhanatāmeva vidadhati|

bhavatu vā hitasādhanagatā kāryatā pravṛttihetustathāpi na kāryatā śabdārthaḥ|
tathā hi pratipattuḥ pravṛttiliṅgeneṣṭasādhanagatakāryatāvagame 'numite niṣpattiyogyatālakṣaṇakāryāṃśabuddheḥ prakṛtyarthakriyāsvarūpamātrāvagamādevānumānena siddhestatra hitasādhanatāṃśe liṅādipratyayasya sāmarthyaṃ kalpyate 'nyathāsiddhasya śabdārthatānupapatteḥ|
na ca gavānayanasya tadānīmanvayavyatirekābhyāṃ hitasādhanatāvagamaḥ phalaprasavādarśanāt|
nāpyanumānamānena gavānayanasyābhimatasādhanatāvyabhicārātkriyāsvarūpasya kālopabandhavikalasya niṣpādanayogyatāvyabhicārabhāvācca|
tasmātkarturabhilaṣitasādhanameva pravṛttihetutayā liṅādipratyayārtha iti sthitam|

atra kaścidāha---kiṃ gavānayanaṃ svarūpeṇa karturabhilaṣitasādhanaṃ kiṃ vājñaptatvāt|
svarūpeṇa cedgavānayanamanusmaranpūrvasiddhagavānayanadṛṣṭahitasādhanatānumānena svayameva pravarteta|
ājñaptatvāccedvede na prakṛtyarthasya hitasādhanatāsiddhirājñaptatābhāvāt|
tadabhāvaścāpauruṣeyatvādvedasyeti|
tatrāha---

sādhanatvaṃ svataḥ siddhaṃ viśeṣasya tu kāryavat|
pradhānābhimatadvāraṃ prayoktrāpi vivakṣyate|| 53

atra bhavānapi codanīyaḥ ---kiṃ gavānayanaṃ svarūpeṇa kāryaṃ kiṃ vājñaptatayeti|
svarūpeṇa cetpakṣāntaravadgavānayanāntarasiddhaṃ kāryamanusmṛtya svayamevānutiṣṭhet|

kāryārthasya pramāṇāntarāyogyatvāttato 'pratipatterna śabdamantareṇa pravṛttiriti cet---tatra prayoktuḥ prayogaśca na syāt|
ata eva pravṛttirapi śroturna syādaprayuktācchabdādarthānadhigamāt|

ājñaptatayā cedvede kāryoparāgābhāvaḥ|
ājñaptatayaiva ca kāryatāsiddherna tatra śabdasāmarthyakalpanā|
nājñoparāgātkāryatādhyeṣaṇādau vede cābhāvaprasaṅgāt|
atha pravartakamātroparāgaḥ kāryoparāgaḥ|
sa ca svato vā preṣaṇādhyeṣaṇābhyanujñānibandhano vobhayathāpyukto doṣaḥ|

atha bālasya svapravṛttau gavānayanaṃ na svarūpeṇa kāryaṃ kiṃ tvabhilaṣitasamarthanopādhau|
evaṃ prayogāviṣayamapi gavānayanamātmano 'bhilaṣitaṃ samarthayatkāryaṃ bhavati|
taccābhilaṣitaṃ praiṣādikarturabhilaṣitasamarthanadvāreṇa karturapi samarthyate|
ato gavānayanaviśeṣa eva karturarthataḥ kāryeṇoparajyate|
tacca śabdādevāvagamyate gavānayanamātrasya karturabhilaṣitasamarthanasya vyabhicārādanumānena kāryatāyāḥ pratipattumaśakyatvāttaddvāreṇa tasya kāryoparāgajñānāyogāditi|

tarhi tasyaiva tathāvidhaṃ hitasādhanatvamupadeśādevāvagamyatām|
tasya ca gavānayanaviśeṣasya sadvāraṃ hitasādhanatvaṃ kāryatvamiva kartuḥ svarūpaprayuktameva kalpyatām|
tathāvidhe phalalakṣite viśeṣite vā sādhane liṅādiśabdaprayoga iti yathā kartuḥ kṛtiviśeṣite tadupalakṣite vā kārye liṅādiprayogo yathā vā purovartitvaviśiṣṭe tadupalakṣite vā ghaṭādāvidaṃśabdaprayogaḥ|

nanu prayoktā svātmano 'bhilaṣitasādhanaṃ gavānayanaṃ vivakṣati na tu karturabhilaṣitasādhanam|
tatra kathaṃ karturabhilaṣitasādhane śabdaprayogaḥ|
aprayukte ca kathaṃ tatra sambandhajñānam|
naivaitaccodyaṃ kārye 'pi tulyatvāt|
prayoktā hi svātmanaḥ kartavyaṃ pratipadya pareṇa sādhayituṃ vacaḥ prayukṅte na prayojyasya kartavyaṃ vivakṣitvā prayuṅkte|
tatra kathaṃ niyojyasya kārye śabdasāmarthyaṃ na hyanyakāryādanyaḥ pravartate|

nanūpadeśe prayojyakartavyataiva vivakṣyate|
hitasādhanatāpi tathā prayojyaṃ pratyevopadeśe vivakṣyate|
atha praiṣādiṣvapi prayoktā svakartavyanirvartanaṃ prayojyasyāpi kartavyamiti vivakṣati tarhi svābhimatanirvartanaṃ prayojyasyābhimataṃ nirvartayatīti paramparayā karturabhilaṣitasādhanaṃ vivakṣyata eva prayoktrā|
tasmādyathā parābhimatakārye 'pi prayojyapravṛttidarśanāttasya svakartavyatājñānamevānumāya tatra sambandho gṛhyate svakāryajñānādeva pravṛttestathābhilaṣitasādhanajñāne 'pīti na viśeṣaṃ paśyāmaḥ|

nanu jātasya jantorādyā karacaraṇavinyāsādipravṛttirna hitasādhanajñānāttasya phalaprasavanonneyatvāt|
nanu kāryajñānaṃ vā kuto jāyate|
na tāvatpratyakṣeṇeti vakṣyate|
sambandhajñānābhāvānnānumānādinā|
athābuddhipūrvā sā pravṛttiriti heturna mṛgyate|
itarasyāpi tattulya|
atha janmāntarīyakāryajñānasaṃskārātsa jāyate---tathāvidhādevābhilaṣitasādhanajñānasaṃskārātsā kiṃ na syāt|
tasmāttata eva pravṛttiriti siddham||

nanu kimidaṃ hitasādhanatvaṃ nāma|
kiṃ vastusvarūpamātraṃ taddharmo vā|
na svarūpamātraṃ pratyakṣagamyatvāttasya sādhanatāyāśca tathānavagamāt|
na dharmastatsadbhāve pramāṇābhāvāditi|
tatrāha---

anvayavyatirekābhyāṃ padārthātiśaye pramā|
jāyate 'nyaprayukteṣu vyavahāro 'nyathā katham|| 54

aviśiṣṭe 'pi padārthasvarūpe phalaprasavānyathānupapattyā kaścittatsādhanasāmarthyātiśayaḥ kalpyate|
nanu pravṛttiviṣayatāmāpannātphalaprasavo na svabhāvasiddhātphalaprasavonnītasādhanācca pravṛttiritītaretarāśrayatā|
na parapravṛttiviṣayīkṛtapadārthaprasūtaphaladarśanādapi tatsādhanatāvagamāt|
anyathā kathamabhilaṣitaphalāya kasyacidevopādānalakṣaṇo vyavahāraḥ|
tasmādastyevāsāvatiśayaḥ|

nanu praiṣādiṣvabhiprāyabhedeṣu nirūpitasambandhā liṅādayaḥ kathaṃ hitasādhanatāmabhidadhyuḥ|
nopadeśe tadabhidhānadarśanāt|
nanu tatrāpyanugraho 'bhidheyaḥ|
na tadabhāve 'pyadṛṣṭabhayādupadeśāttatra hitasādhanatvameva vivakṣyate|
praiṣādiṣvapi paramparayā tadvivakṣā darśitā|
pravṛttihetau ca sambandhajñānādājñādimātrādapravṛtteḥ sa eva śabdārtho nājñādisteṣu sambandhajñānābhāvādbālasya dṛṣṭāntābhāvādvaktṛpratipattrorutkarṣāpakarṣamukhavikārādiliṅgānumeyatayānyathāsiddhatvāccājñādīnām|
kiṃ ca---

rāgātpravṛtteriṣṭādestaddhetutvānna kāryatā|
pravṛttihetū rāgaśca na śābdaḥ sākṣisiddhitaḥ|| 55

nanu rāgasya kāryatājñānameva hetuḥ|
na satīṣṭādāvutpatterasati cānutpatteriṣṭādireva tannimittam|
nanviṣṭādeḥ kāryajñānaṃ tato rāga iti kāraṇakāraṇatayānyathāsiddhirasti|
tanna| yadi kṛtiviṣayīkārayogyatā kāryatā sā prakṛtyarthalakṣaṇakriyāsvarūpajñānādeva kālasambandhajñānavikalātsvaniṣpāditapūrvasiddhakriyānidarśanenānumānena sidhyati neṣṭasādhanajñānamapekṣate|
yadi vā buddhipūrvakāriṇaḥ kṛtyupakṣepayogyatā kāryatā tadeṣṭatā tatsādhanatā vā setīṣṭādereva rāga ityuktaṃ bhavati|
yadi tṛtīyameva kiṃcitkāryabuddhyālambanaṃ kalpyeta tathāpi hitādereva rāgaḥ kāryatābuddhiścetyekakāraṇajanyatā tayoriti na rāgasya hitādiḥ kāraṇakāraṇaṃ niṣpanne 'pi kadalīphalādau hitasādhane bhakṣaṇaviśeṣaṇatayā rāgaviṣayīkārādanyathā hitādijñānādrāgo rāgajñānācca kāryatājñānamiti kalpanāyāmapyaviśeṣāt|
nanu hitasādhanatāvagamaḥ kāryatājñānādhīnaḥ kiṃ na syāt|
kāryatāyāṃ pramāṇāntarābhāvātsādhanatāyāṃ tu phalaprasavānyathānupapattiruktā phale tvānukūlyaṃ pratyakṣasiddham|
yatra ca hitatatsādhanatāvamastatraiva kāryabuddhiniyamātsa eva taddheturiti kalpyate|
ataḥ pratipattuḥ pravṛttiliṅgena pravartakaṃ rāgamanumāya tasya ca svasākṣikatayā śabdānapekṣatvāttaddhetau hitasādhanajñāne śabdasāmarthyaṃ kalpyata iti ramaṇīyam|

kiṃ ceyaṃ kāryabuddhiravalambata iti parīkṣyate---

na niyogaṃ na niṣpādyaṃ kṛtiraktaṃ na kāryadhīḥ|
nirupādhikasādhyaṃ vā viviktaṃ kālato 'pi na|| 56

ālambate na cāpūrvaṃ na pradhānaṃ kṛtiṃ prati|
pravartakatvaṃ nābhāvavirodhi vyabhicārataḥ|| 57

vyabhicārata iti sarvatra sambadhyate|

na tāvatkāryabuddhirniyogamavalambate|
niyogo hi nāma cetanasya pradhānasyāpradhānacetanaṃ prati pravartanālakṣaṇo 'bhiprāyabhedaḥ prasiddhaḥ|
sa ca bālasya svatantrapravṛttau vede ca kāryabuddhiṃ vyabhicarati tathāvidhapuruṣasambandhajñānābhāvāt|
nāpi kṛtiviṣayīkārayogyatāmātramavalambate tasyākāryabuddhigocare 'pi duḥkhādau vidyamānatvādvyabhicārāt|
nāpi varamānakṛtisaṃsṛṣṭamarthamavalambate kāryabuddhyadhīnatvātkṛtyutpatteḥ kāryabuddhisamaye kṛtisaṃsargasya vyabhicārāt|
na ca nirupādhikasādhyaṃ kāryaṃ sukhādereva tadbhāvātsopādhikasādhye 'pi sādhane kāryabuddhidarśanācca|
na ca sukhaduḥkhanivṛttivyatirekeṇa nirupādhikasādhyaṃ nāma kiṃcidasti|

atha kālaviviktaṃ kāryabuddhirālambate|
kiṃ śabdato 'rthato vā kālavivekaḥ|
śabdataścedghaṭādiśrutayo 'pi na kālasambandhinamarthamabhidadhatīti tadutpannabuddhīnāmapi kāryabuddhitvaprasaṅgaḥ|
arthataścecchaśaviṣāṇabuddherapi tatprasaṅgaḥ|
tadeva hi tucchaṃ yannābhūdasti bhaviṣyati|
nanu kāryamityukte kālasambandho na pratīyate tathāpi na tucchatāvagatiḥ|
satyaṃ śabdataḥ kālasambandhānavagamo ghaṭādiśrutijanyapratītāvapi tulya ityuktam|
arthataḥ kālavivekaḥ kenāvagamyate|
na kāryabuddhyaiva tasyāstāvanmātraniṣṭhatvāt|
atha saiva kālaśūnyatāmapi pratipādayetkasyeti na jānīmaḥ|
kāryasyeti cet---na tasyaiva nirūpyamānatvāt|
kālavivikto 'rthaḥ sa iti cet---tarhi tādṛśo 'rthaḥ kālastucchaṃ veti kutastucchatāvivekaḥ|
kāryasya ca tucchavailakṣaṇyamicchatā pratītito 'bhāve 'pyarthataḥ kālasambandho vaktavyo ghaṭādiṣviva kālasambandhānumānāt|

apūrvamapi laukikakāryabuddhivyabhicārānna tadālambanam|
na ca vede 'pi tatsambhavo mānābhāvāt|
svargakāmino yāgakartavyatānyathānupapattiriti cet---saiva hi kartavyatā na nirjñāyate|
na niyogādiriti coktam|
svargasādhanatā cetkānupapattirapūrvamantareṇa|
kṣaṇapradhvaṃsino yāgasya kālāntaravartiphalasādhanatānupapannā|
na tarhyapūrvamātreṇa tadupapattirviśiṣṭaśarīrendriyābhāvāt|
tadapyapekṣitaṃ lokasiddhānumānena gamyatām|
tarhi yāgasya svargasādhanatvamapekṣitārthopasaṃhāre 'pi na virudhyate cecchrutismṛtiśatasaṃdṛbdhādeveśvarāttadavagatigocaranirvṛttakarmāpekṣayā phalasiddhernāpūrvakalpanāvakāśaḥ|
nāpi tasya śabdābhidheyatā śabdārthānupapattigamyatvādagṛhītasambandhatvācca|
na ca tatraiva sambandhagraho liṅādyabhidheyaprakṛtyarthakartavyatādvāreṇa tatsādhanatādvāreṇaiva vāpūrvakalpanādekasminprayoge krameṇāvagamyābhidheyadvayakalpanāyogāt|
na ca liṅādisvarūpamātrasya padāntarābhidheyārthasya vāpūrvamantareṇānupapattirabhidheyāntarābhāvadanupapattyabhāvācca|
tasmādvede nāpūrvaṃ tadabhidhānaṃ vā kalpanīyam|

atha kṛtiṃ prati pradhānaṃ kāryam|
kiṃ tatprādhānyam|
buddhipūrvakāriṇaḥ kṛtyupakṣepayogyatā|
tarhi sukhaṃ duḥkhanivṛttistatsādhanaṃ vā kāryamiti naimittikādau karmaṇi kāryabuddhivyabhicāraḥ|
na ca pravartakatvamātraṃ rāge kāryabuddhyabhāvāt|
praiṣāderiṣṭādeśca vede vyabhicāraḥ prasiddhaḥ|
pravṛttyabhāvavirodhī ca rāgo vā pravṛttirvā hitādirvā nānyadityuktam|

nanu kāryabuddhisāmarthyādevāvalambanaṃ kalpyatām|
satyaṃ nānyadataḥ kalpyate kṛtiviṣayayogyatāmātre 'vayavārthe sambhavati|
nanu kāryamityukte pravartakarūpamapi kiṃcidantargarbhitaṃ pratīyate|
satyaṃ viṣayasya kṛtyupakṣepayogyatālakṣaṇaṃ hitasādhanatvameva tat|
nanu kāryabuddhau hitasādhanatā na pratīyate|
naivam| pravartakabuddhau tadapyantargarbhitaṃ pratīyate|

athavā hitādeḥ kṛtiniṣpādyatāyāśca vilakṣaṇasyālambanasyānirūpaṇāddhitasādhanatālambanaḥ pravartakarūpaḥ kāryamityabhiniveśo rāga eva mamedaṃ bhūyāditivanna pramāṇaṃ pramāṇahetvabhāvācca|
katham|

nākṣamāpātato 'bhāvānnātaḥ śabdānume pramā|
nārthāpattirato rāgaḥ kāryamityeṣa na pramā|| 58

na tāvatparasya parāśraye gavānayanādisvarūpe ghaṭādau vā pratyakṣe tatkāryatāpi pratyakṣeṇāvasīyate|
vartamānatvādgavānayanādestatra kāryatvābhāvādanadhyakṣateti cet---avartamāne tarhi gavānayanādau tadvyapāśrayasya kāryārthasya sutarāṃ na pratyakṣatā nāpi svātantryeṇānavagamāt|

nanu na gamanādikriyā pratyakṣānumeyā tu|
kena liṅgena| vyavasthitasya dravyasya kādācitkasaṃyogavibhāgābhyām|
tathā hi saṃyogavibhāgajanyaṃ kāryaṃ kādācitkaṃ svāśrayasaṃygoavibhāgalakṣaṇātiśayapuraḥsaraṃ dṛṣṭam|
tathā saṃyogavibhāgāvapi kādācitkau svāśrayātiśayapuraḥsarau|
yo 'sāvatiśayaḥ saṃyogavibhāgahetuḥ sā kriyeti|

naitatsāram|
yā sā kriyā sā svāśraye kādācitkā vā na vā|
na cetsaṃyogavibhāganityatāpatteḥ kādācitkatvāditi hetorasiddhatāprasaṅgaḥ|
kādācitkā cetsāpi svāśrayātiśayapuraḥsarā vā na vā|
na cedanaikāntikastatra hetuḥ|
atiśayapuraḥsarā cedanavasthānātsaṃyogavibhāgalakṣaṇadharmyasiddhiprasaṅgaḥ|
anāditvātparamparāyā nasiddhiriti cet--nādyajātasya prathamakriyotpatteḥ svāśrayātiśayāntarāyogāttatrānaikāntikatvāt|
ata eva na parāśrayā kriyāpi tatsaṃyogavibhāgābhyāṃ sidhyati|

kiṃ ca satorapi śyenasthāṇusaṃyogavibhāgayorna sthāṇuḥ kriyāvāniti hetoranaikāntikatā|
svadeśasaṃyogavibhāgau deśinaḥ kriyānumānaheturiti cet---na balavadavadhṛtaśarīreṣu matsyādiṣu srotasi svadeśasaṃyogavibhāgayoḥ satirapi kriyājñānābhāvāt|
kiṃ ca śabdavidyutoriva kṣaṇikatve 'pi calatīti vartamānapratyayānna phalenātivṛttakriyānumānametaditi yujyate|
tasmātpratyakṣaiva kriyā|

ataḥ pratyakṣakriyāśrayaḥ svatantro vā na pratyakṣagamyaḥ kāryārthaḥ|
ata eva sambandhajñānāyogānna śabdānumānagamyaḥ|

na ca pravṛttiviṣayatānyathānupapattistadgatakāryārthādhigamanī viṣayaviśeṣapravṛtteḥ phalaprasavānupapattisiddhābhilaṣitasādhanaviśeṣanibandhanatvasiddherapūrvapadārthakalpanāyogādanyathā phalānapekṣāyāṃ kvacitpravṛttiḥ kvacidapravṛttiriti niyamo na syāt|
satyapi sādhane phalābhilāṣāyāṃ niyamābhāvātpravṛttyapravṛttī yujyete|

nanu kāryamapīcchopasaṃhāramukhenaiva pravartayatīti yujyate niyamaḥ|
na tasyānavagame tadupasaṃhāramukhena pravartakatvānavagamāt|
phalaṃ tu sukhaṃ duḥkhanivṛttirvā pratyakṣameva|
tadākārecchā niyamavikalā svānubhavasiddhā|
phalaprasavānyathānupapattyā ca tadanukūlasādhanātiśayo 'pyarthāpattigamyaḥ|
hitasādhanajñānānantaraṃ ca tadākāravatīcchā svānubhavagamyā|
tadevaṃ hitasādhanamicchopasaṃhāramukhena pravartayati|

atha phalasādhanataiva kāryatā|
nāmni vipratipattiḥ|
atha phalena kāryameva sādhanatayā kalpyate|
na pratyakṣasiddhapadārthasyaiva sādhanatāsambhave padārthāntaraṃ sādhanatvaṃ ca kalpayataḥ kalpanāgauravātsiddhaghaṭādīnāmapyabhilaṣitakriyāsādhanatvadarśanāt|
ata eva na kāryatvameva sādhanateti na sādhanatāpahnavaḥ śakyate kartum|
ato nārthāpattyā kāryapadārthāvagamaḥ||

tasmātpramāṇābhāvātprameyābhāvācca kāryamiti pravartakākāro 'bhiniveśo rāga eveti siddham|

ato hitasādhanatābhidhānamukhena vede 'pi liṅādayaḥ saṃnihitapadopāttasvargasādhanatāmeva viśeṣeṇābhidadhyuḥ|
naimittikādau ca kāmaśruterabhāvānnimittaśruteśca nityānvayātkalpyamānanityābhilaṣitāpāyanibarhaṇasādhanatvaviśeṣamevābhidadhyuriti śliṣyate|

anyathākasmikārthāḥ syurvede kāryārthaniṣṭhataḥ|
kriyayā na samanveti niyojyasya viśeṣaṇam|| 59

aprakalpyamāne śabdasya hitasādhanasāmarthye vede kāryārthamātraniṣṭhatvātphalasādhanatānavagamādākasmikasuḥkhaduḥkhaprayojanā evotpattyaiva sarve prāṇinaḥ prasajyeran|
nanu niyogasāmarthyādeva dhātvarthasya phalasādhanatāvagamyate|
nānāptaniyoge naimittikādau ca vyabhicārāt|
na cānāptavākyādviṣayaniyojyavyāvṛttaniyogapramitau pramāṇāntaravirodhaḥ|
sādhyasādhanasambandhavirodhastu na śābdīṃ niyogapramitiṃ niruṇaddhyaśābdatvāttasya|
āptaniyoge phalasādhanatā syāditi cet---na vede tadabhāvādapauruṣeyatvāt|

nanu kāminaḥ pravṛttyupadeśaḥ kāmopāye bhavati|
nātatsādhane 'pi phalakāmanāyā niyojyaviśeṣaṇatvadarśanādyathā krāmādikāmeṣvanekeṣu dvāraṃ pratyāsanneṣu kaścidbhojayitā vijñātenaiva viśeṣaṇena niyojyaṃ viśinaṣṭyanyeṣāṃ nivṛttaye---grāmakāmāgaccheti|
na tatrāgamanaṃ grāmasādhanam|
nanu na tatra grāmakāmanānibandhanā pravṛttiḥ kiṃ tu bhojanakāmanānimittetyatatsādhanatā|
satyamitaratrāpi tattulyam|
na svargakāmanānimittā pravṛttiḥ kiṃ tu niyoganimittā|

atha kāmyeṣu kāmanibandhanā bhāvārtheṣu pravṛttiriti tasya kāmopāyatā sidhyet|
netaretarāśrayātkāmanimittapravṛttiviṣayatvātkāmopāyatāsiddhistadupāyatve ca siddhe tannibandhanā tatra pravṛttiriti|
nanu svargādeḥ kāmopabandhātsādhyatāpratīteḥ sādhanākāṅkṣāyāṃ dhātvarthaḥ sādhanatvena sambadhyate|
na gamanāderapi tatsādhanatāprasaṅgāt|
avihitatvānneti cet---vihitaṃ sambadhyata iti kutaḥ| phalasākāṅkṣatvāt|
na nityādau vyabhicārāt|
nanvasti tatrāpyapāyaparihāraḥ phalam|
ihāpi tarhi yatkiṃcitphalaṃ kalpyatām|

nanu sādhyasvarge saṃnihite kutaḥ phalāntarāvakāśaḥ|
ucyate---sati hyanyasminpramitihetāvākāṅkṣāsaṃnidhī saṃsargetikartavyatāmanubhavato na svayameva saṃsargaṃ pramimāte|
neha pramitiheturasti|
niyogo hi svasiddhimātraniṣṭho na viṣayaphalasambandhamantareṇānupapannaḥ|
niyogo 'pi vihitasyaphalamantareṇānupapanno 'nyathā tatra pravṛttyayogāditi cet---tarhi satyapi vidhāvabhilaṣitasādhanāvagamādeva pravṛtteḥ sa eva śabdārthatayā vidhiriti kimantargaḍunā niyogena|
puruṣābhiprāyabhedatvācca tasya na vede sambhava ityuktam|

nanu viṣayaniyojyayorekaniyogasambandhasāmarthyātparasparasambandhe sati niyojyaviśeṣaṇasyāpi svargasya dhātvarthena sambandhātsambandhasya ca guṇapradhānabhāvamantareṇāyogātsvargaḥ sādhyatvātprādhānyenāvatiṣṭhate|
ko 'yaṃ niyojyo nāma|
mamāyaṃ niyoga iti pratipattā|
tarhi rājño 'pi svaniyoge niyojyatvaprasaṅgaḥ|
kaścāyaṃ mamāyamiti sambandhaḥ|
yadi kartṛkaraṇīyatā tarhi rājño 'pi niyojyatāprasaṅgaḥ|
na ca svasvāmisambandhanimittaṃ krayādilakṣaṇamatra vidyate|
atha viṣayaviṣayitā sambandhaḥ|
nābhiprāyabhedatvābhāve viṣayānapekṣatvāt|
atha kāryārthapratipattā niyojyaḥ|
na niyoktū rājño 'pi prasaṅgāt|
athoddeśyaścetano niyojyaḥ|
noddeśena sambandhānirūpaṇāt|

satyapi niyojye svargakāmanā na tadviśeṣaṇaṃ bhavati|
sambhave 'vyabhicāre ca viśeṣaṇamarthavaducyate|
na tāvaddarśapūrṇamāsaniyogasya puruṣeṇāyogyo vyavacchidyate viśeṣaṇena yāvajjīvaśrutereva niyogasiddheḥ|
nāpyanyayogavyavacchedo 'svargakāmino 'pi pradoṣakālavyāvṛttajīvane satyanuṣṭheyatvāt|
bhavadapīdamupalakṣaṇaṃ bhavenna viśeṣaṇaṃ puruṣasyaiva niyojyatvātsvargakāmanāyā niyojyatvābhāvāt|
kāryasambandhāsambandhābhyāṃ hi sambandhyantaraniyāmakatvādviśeṣaṇopalakṣaṇavibhāgaḥ|
ato viṣayaniyojyasambandhaṃ kurvannapi niyogaḥ puruṣasambandhameva karoti viṣayasya nopalakṣaṇasambandham|

sambandhe vā jīvanāderapi viṣayasambandhaḥ syāt|
tatra bhāvārthaṃ prati guṇatvena sambandhe jīvanāderaṅgatvāpatterdarśapūrṇamāsavikṛtāvapi jīvanāderatideśaprasaṅgaḥ|
prādhānye jīvanāderapi sādhyatāprasaṅgātsarvāṅgopasaṃhārasya nitye 'pi karmaṇi prasaṅgaḥ|
kiṃ ca kāmasya niyojyaviśeṣaṇatve sati tasminniyogasambandhājjīvanādivannimittatvāpatterakaraṇe pratyavāyo 'pi syāt||

tasmātpratyayena phalasādhanatāmātre 'vagate tadviśeṣākāṅkṣāyāṃ svargakāmapadaṃ samāsasāmarthyātpuruṣapradhānamapi svargasya kāmaviṣayatayā sādhyatāpratītestatparatayā phalaviśeṣasamarpakatvena sambadhyate|
arthāttatkāminastatrādhikāra iti ramaṇīyam|

nanu tiṅkṛttaddhitasamāsaiḥ 
anabhita 
iti viśeṣaṇāttiṅā yāgasya karaṇatāyāmabhihitāyāṃ jyotiṣṭomeneti tṛtīyā nopapadyata ityata āha---

tiṅādibhiranirdiṣṭe tṛtīyā na virudhyate|
paunaruktyānniṣedhokterbhinnārthāpāśrayānna tat|| 60

na tāvattiṅkṛttaddhitasamāsaiḥ 
anabhihite
iti niṣedho dṛṣṭārthaḥ kiṃ tu ghaṭaṃ kriyata ityukte pratyayābhyāṃ ghaṭagatakarmakārakatvasyābhidhāne paunaruktyāttannivāraṇāya niṣedhaḥ|
tatra dīrgheṇa daṇḍena śuklāṃ gāmānayeti dvirabhidhāne 'pi yathā bhinnaprakṛtyarthasambandhikārakatvāṃśabhedānna paunaruktyaprasaṅgastathā yajatijyotiṣṭomaśabdābhidheyasāmānyaviśeṣaprakṛtyarthasambandhikārakatvāṃśabhedātsuptiṅbhyāmekaikakārakatvābhidhāne na kaściddoṣaḥ|
tiṅā ca karaṇatābhidhānābhāve pratiṣedho 'pyaprāpta eva syāt|
kārakāntaraviṣayo vāyaṃ pratiṣedhaḥ||

nanu kāmanāpadasya phalasamarpakatve karmaṇyadhikārī na sidhyati|
phalasādhanasya vākyārthatve kāmyanityavibhāgo 'pi na syādityata āha---

yasyeṣṭasādhanaṃ tasyādhikāraśca prasidhyati|
vibhāgaḥ kāmyanityāderviśeṣaṇavibhāgataḥ|| 61

yasyābhilaṣitamidaṃ karma sādhayati tasyedaṃ karmeti karmaṇā puruṣasya svasvāmitānvayo niyogenaiva sāmarthyātsidhyati|
upakārakabhāve 'vagate tadarthamupādānādapi svatvamupapadyate|
nanu yajetetyukte yāgo mama kartavya iti pratīyate na yāgo mameṣṭasādhanamiti|
na niyogabhāvanāvādinorapi yāgakāryatāpratīterniyogabhāvanāpratītyuttarakālīnatvādihāpīṣṭasādhanatāpratītyanantarabhāvitvaṃ na virudhyate|
ataḥ prathamaṃ karmaṇi svābhilaṣitasādhane svāmitvenānvayaṃ pratipadya paścātkartṛtvenānvetītyadhikāriṇaḥ kartṛtvamapi yujyate|

yatra phalaparamapi padaṃ puruṣeṇa śrūyamāṇenādhyāhriyamāṇena vā sambadhya saṃsarge nairākāṅkṣyaṃ pratipādayati tatra kāmyatā|
yatra viśeṣaṇāntaraviśiṣṭena nairākāṅkṣyaṃ tatra nityatā|
phalaṃ ca nityatāsāmarthyādeva nityābhilaṣitāpāyaparihāraḥ|

phalabhedasiddhau ca darśapūrṇamāsalakṣaṇe karmaṇyadhikāravākyadvayopayogaḥ|
na ca puruṣaviśeṣaṇayoḥ kāmanājīvanayoḥ kasyacit phalaparatā kasyacinnimittaparateti vairūpyaṃ doṣo niyojyaviśeṣaṇatvāyogādavaśyābhyupagantavyatvāt|
na ca jīvanamapi niyojyaviśeṣaṇaṃ sambhavati yāvajjīvanasya sādhyatvādyaugapadyāyogājjīvanamātrasyāvaktavyatvāt|
nimittapakṣe tu paunaḥpunyāya yāvacchabdaḥ|
tasmādiṣṭasādhanapakṣe na kaściddoṣa iti sthitam|

tasmātkāryānvite śabdasāmarthyaniyamābhāvādanyānvite sāmarthyamityupasaṃharati---

ato 'nyānvitasāmarthyaṃ padānāṃ pariniścitam|
nyāyairuktaprakāreṇa yathāśakti pradarśitaiḥ|| 62

atrākāṅkṣāsaṃnidhiyogyatāsāmarthyātpadāni saṃsargaṃ pratipādayantīti prasiddham|
keyamākāṅkṣā|
padārthe pratipanne pratipatturarthāntaraviṣayā jijñāsā|
kiṃnibandhanā sā kuto vā nivartata ityata āha---

abhidhānānavasānājjijñāsārthācca jāyate|
prayojanāvasānācca padārthe sā nivartate|| 63

anvitābhidhāyinaḥ śabdādabhidheyaikadeśe sahakāryabhāvādavagate 'bhidhānamevāparyavasitamabhidheyaikadeśāntare jijñāsāmutpādayati|
kvacidarthācca viśvajidādiṣu jijñāsā jāyate|
ubhayavidhā ca prayojanasamarthasaṃsargasiddhau nivartata iti|
kā punaryogyatā| jijñāsānivartakatvenānvayasāmarthyam|
kaḥ punaḥ saṃnidhiḥ| ananvayipadārthāntarāvyavadhānena buddhau viparivṛttiḥ||

kimākāṅkṣādisāmarthyātpadāni yugapatsaṃsargabuddhmutpādayanti kiṃ vā krameṇāpīti|
krameṇāpītyāha---

saṃsargabuddhiṃ śabdāśca krameṇaiva vitanvate|
sākāṅkṣakramasaṃsargabuddhidṛṣṭeḥ prayuktiṣu|| 64

gāmityukte prakṛtipratyayau govyāvṛttaṃ karmakārakaṃ bodhayantau kriyāyāṃ jijñāsāmutpādayataḥ|
ānayatipadasaṃnidhānāttu tatsahakāriṇau punaḥ kriyayā saṃsargaṃ pratipādayataḥ kramavatsaṃsargapadārthākāṅkṣayordarśanātsakṛtprayuktasyāpi padasya sahakārisaṃnidhāne smaryamāṇe 'sya punarbuddhihetutvopapatteḥ|
tasmātsiddhaṃ padānāmanvitābhidhānasāmarthyātsaṃsargapratipādakatvam|

nanvevamapyabhidhānābhidheyasambandhasya sāṃketikatvādvākasya ca lokavatpauruṣeyatvāddharmādharmabrahmasu ca pratyayāntarāyogānna śabdānāṃ teṣu prāmāṇyamityata āha---

svārthapravṛttamāpūrvajanyaścedveda iṣyate|
īśvarajñānavanna syātkāryatve siddhasādhanam|| 65

yadi tāvatsvārthapravṛttapramāṇāntarajanyatvaṃ nāma pauruṣeyatvaṃ vedasya sādhyate tatra pratyanumānam---vedaḥ svārthapravṛttapramāṇāntarajanyo na bhavatyanīśvarabuddhitatkāryatvābhāve sati dharmādharmabrahmapramāṇatvādīśvarajñānavat|
īśvaravādināmapauruṣeyatvena prāmāṇyavādināṃ ca pratyanumānam||

atha na prāmāṇyaṃ dharmādiṣu vedasyetyasiddho heturnāpīśvara ityāśrayahīno dṛṣṭānta iti|
tarhi kiṃ sādhyate|
kāryatāmātraṃ cetsiddhasādhanam|
yadi varṇāḥ pratyuccāraṇaṃ niṣpādyante tadā ta eva kramaviśeṣasamārūḍhatayā vedaśabdābhidheyā iti pratyuccāraṇaṃ vedo niṣpādyate|
yadi vā nityā varṇāstathāpyupalabdhyādikramaviśeṣasambhinnā eva veda iti pratyuccāraṇaṃ niṣpādyate|
kramaviśeṣasādṛśyaparamparāyā anidaṃprathamatvācca vede nityatābhidhānam|

atha vedādhyayanābhidhānābhidheyasambandhayoridaṃprathamatā sādhyate|
tatrāha---

vedādhyayanaśabdārthavyavahārau yathādhunā|
tathaiva pūrvakāle 'pītyanumānaṃ pravartatām|| 66

vivādādhyāsitau vedādhyayanaśabdārthavyavahārau pūrvapūrvapravṛttatathāvidhādhyayanādinibandhanau vedādhyayanāditvādidānīṃtanavedādhyayanādivat|
na ca vākyādhyayanatvādbhāratādivadidaṃprathamatānumānaṃ sāmānyatodṛṣṭasya vedādhyayanatvāditi viśeṣatodṛṣṭavirodhe durbalatvāt|
na cāgamavirodhaḥ sṛṣṭiśruterniṣpādyatāmātraviṣayatvāt|

nanu sarvajñaśruterīśvaro dharmādharmādyupalabhya vedaṃ kariṣyati|
na nirapekṣaprāmāṇyamantareṇa sarvajñatvāsiddheḥ kiṃ ceśvaraḥ svarūpajñānena sarvajño na tatra lokavadvāgādīni vākyaracanākaraṇāni santi yuktāvasthāyāmiva yoginām|
atha vigrahopādānena vāgādibhirvākyaṃ kuryāt|
na tatra caitanyasyāvacchedādasarvajñatvādviyuktāvasthāyāmiva yoginām|
atha svarūpajñānena sarvamupalabhya vigrahopādānena sarvamupalabdhamanusmaranvākyaṃ kuryāt|
na svarūpajñānasya saṃskārābhāvāt|
na ca dharmādharmabrahmasu pramāṇāntaramasti|

atra svayūthyairidamuktam---mā bhūddharmādharmayormānāntarayogyatā|
brahmaṇastu bhūtatvānmānāntarayogyatvāttadviṣayavedāntavākyānāṃ pauruṣeyatvameva syādatastatparihārāya teṣāmapi kāryaniṣṭhatā varṇayitavyeti|
tathā ca satsamprayoge
iti mānāntarayogyatvamapauruṣeyatvasiddhaye nirākṛtaṃ yogyatve tu pauruṣeyatā syāditi|
naitatsāramayogyaviṣayasyāpi buddhādivākyasya pauruṣeyatvadarśanādyogyaviṣayasyāpi 
vāyurvai kṣepiṣṭhāḥ 
ityāderapauruṣeyatvadarśanācca|
vidhisaṃsarge 'pyarthavādena na vidhiḥ pratipādyate kiṃ tu praśaṃsādireva pramāṇāntarayogyo 'rthaḥ|
tasmādanyadeva pauruṣeyatvādeḥ kāraṇam|

atha mā bhūtpauruṣeyatvamapauruṣeyatvaṃ tu kutaḥ|
nāsādhyatvāt|
prāmāṇyaṃ tarhi vedasya katham|
tasminsatyabādhyamānapramitijananāt|
śābdapramitestu bādho 'pekṣyamāṇapramitibādhāt|
pauruṣeyatvābhāvāttu pramityantarāpekṣā nāstītyuktam|
tasmādabādhaḥ|

ataḥ siddhaṃ brahmaṇi śabdasya prāmāṇyamityāha---

ataḥ satyādiśabdāstu saṃsṛṣṭārthoktiśaktitaḥ|
mānāntarasyāviṣayaṃ bhūtārthaṃ bodhayanti naḥ|| 67

ke punaḥ śabdā brahmasvarūpasamarpakāḥ ke punaḥ sopādhikarūpasamarpakā iti tatrāha---

anupādhipravṛttābhirjñānānandasaduktibhiḥ|
svasāmānyābhidhānena vyaktirekā samarpyate|| 68

jñānānandasacchabdāḥ parāparasāmānyavācakatvātsāmānādhikaraṇyācca svasāmānyābhidhānamukhenaikāmānandavyaktimaparasāmānyavyañjitāṃ brahmatvena lakṣayanti 
sanmūrtaṃ dravyaṃ kuḍyamiti ca parāparasāmānyānāmekatra vṛttidarśanāt|
tathā ca yato vā imāni bhūtāni jāyante
iti lakṣaṇaṃ nirdiśya
ānandāddhyeva khalvimāni
iti lakṣyaṃ brahmānandaṃ nirdiśati|
tatrānandasya paraprakāśyatānivṛttaye jñānaśabdaḥ svabhāvataḥ śūnyatānivṛttaye sacchabdaḥ|
athavā brahmavyatiriktasyānandasya jñānasya sataścābhāvāttatsāmānyayogādbrahmaiva sadādiśabdairabhidhīyate|

nanu tarhi teṣāṃ paryāyatvaprasaṅgaḥ|
na tucchajāḍyaduḥkhavirodhyupādhibhedena pravṛtteḥ|
nanvevaṃ sadādiśabdānāṃ nirupādhikavṛttitvaṃ na syāt|
naiṣa doṣaḥ|
sāmānyopādhau duḥkhādivirodhyupādhau vā niyata ekasminvastuni buddhimutpādayantīti nirupādhikāḥ|
asthūlādiśabdāstvaniyatavastuviṣayā upādhitantrā iti|

nanu tucchādivirodhitvamapratipādyāpi sadādivyavahāro dṛśyate|
tarhi māyānirmitānāmapi jñānānandasatāṃ pratīteḥ sāmānyapakṣa evāśrīyatām|
nanu sāmānyānāmapi māyātmakatvādānandādirūpatā brahmaṇo na syāt|
na| ānandādisāmānyāśrayatvamātratvādānandādisvarūpatāyā na paramārthasāmānyāśrayatvamapekṣyate|
nanu mithyārajatasambhinnā śuktirna rajatamiti vyavahriyate|
satyaṃ rajatābhāsatvāttasya|
iha tu sāmānyāntarābhāvātteṣāman sāmānyābhāsatvam|
tasmādānandādisāmānyāśrayatvādānandādirūpatā brahmaṇaḥ siddhā|

tasya cānandasya mithyātvavirodhaḥ satyaśabdenocyate|
advitīyānantabrahmādiśabdairdeśakālavastuparicchedābhāvaḥ|
asthūlādiśabdairniṣprapañcatā|
sarvajñādiśabdaiḥ prapañcopādhidharmavattā kathyate|
tatra prapañcopādhikadharmāḥ sati prapañce bādhaśūnyā ityetāvatsvarūpeṇa tu māyātmakāḥ|
asthūlādayaśca nivṛttyātmāna iti na paramārthasadadvitīyatāvirodhaḥ|
ānandādiśabdāśca kālpanikasāmānyadvāreṇaikasyāmānandavyaktau paryavasyanti|
dharmadharmivibhāgapratipādanābhāvānna paramārthasadadvitīyatāvirodhaḥ|

athavākāśaśabdavatsacchabdo 'pi ghaṭādiṣvanuvartamānasyaikasyaiva svatantrasya sato vācakaḥ|
jñānānandaśabdau tu sāmānyadvāreṇa tatra vartiṣyete|
evaṃ ca sati guṇaguṇisambandhaprayuktā lakṣitalakṣaṇāpi na syāt|
tasmādekamadvitīyamānandarūpaṃ brahma siddham|

tathā jīvasya brahmātmatā nādhyāsādilakṣaṇetyāha---

upakramopasaṃhārāvabhyāso 'pūrvatā phalam|
arthavādopapattī ca yato jīvastataḥ paraḥ|| 69

yasminvākye ṣaḍvidhaṃ tātparyaliṅgaṃ yasminnarthe gamyate tadvākyaṃ tatparamityadhyavasīyate|
tathā copakramopasaṃhārayoraikarūpyam|
amataṃ matamavijñātaṃ vijñātam
ekamevādvitīyaṃ 
aitadātmyamidaṃ sarvam
tattvamasi
iti|
tathābhyāso 'pi
ekamevādvitīyam
tattvamasi
iti punaḥ punarvacanāt|
tathāpūrvatāpi|
na hi brahmātmaikatvaṃ kenacidapi pramāṇāntareṇa gamyate|
tathā phalamapi---ācāryavānpuruṣo veda tasya tāvadeva ciram
ityādi|
tathārthavādo 'pi---anena jīvenātmanānupraviśya
ityādi|
tathā 
tasmādenaṃ svapitītyācakṣate svaṃ hyapīto bhavati
ityādinā śarīrendriyāṇāmannamayatvenānātmatāpratipādanena ca taptaparaśugrahaṇadṛṣṭāntena coktabrahmātmatāsatyābhisaṃdhasya mokṣakathanena cāsyaivārthasyopapādanaṃ kriyate|
kvaciccāvasthātrayavailakṣaṇyenāsaṅgatvopapādanena|
evaṃ yato vedāntavākyeṣu jīvasya brahmātmatāyāṃ vākyatātparyaliṅgānāṃ ṣaṇṇāṃ samuccayo vikalpo vā yathāyogaṃ gamyate 'taḥ paramātmaivāyaṃ jīvaḥ śabdasya ca svabhāvato 'rthaparatvātpratyayaparatvāyogāt|

na ca pramāṇāntaravirodho 'vidyopādhinimittatvādbhedavyavahārasyetyāha---

avidyā bhedikopādhirnātireko na cāpi dhīḥ|
dvayāpekṣatvatulyatvātsuṣuptādāvadarśanāt|| 70

na taṃ vidātha ya imā jajānānyadyuṣmākamantaraṃ babhūva nīhāreṇa prāvṛtā jalpyā cāsutṛpa ukthaśāsaścaranti|
ityasminmantre
anyadyuṣmākamantaraṃ babhūva
ityuktvā kiṃ tadantaramiti vīkṣāyāṃ 
nīhāreṇa prāvṛtāḥ 
iti nīhārasya tamaso vyavadhāyakatvaṃ gamyate|
tamaśca na bāhyaṃ kiṃ tvāntaram|
tacca 
nāsadāsīnno sadāsīttama āsīt
ityādiśruteḥ sadasadvilakṣaṇam|

ahamajñānajaṃ tamaḥ|
nāśayāmyātmabhāvastho jñānadīpena bhāsvatā||

iti smṛterjñānanivartyaṃ ca|
tasmādajñānameva tat|

vibhedajanake 'jñāne nāśamātyantikaṃ gate|
ātmano brahmaṇo bhedamasantaṃ kaḥ kariṣyati||

iti smṛtirajñānameva vyavadhāyakaṃ darśayati|

nanvajñānaṃ kasya kasminniti vīkṣāyāṃ jīvasya brahmaṇīti vaktavyam|
tataścājñānamantareṇa jīvabrahmavibhāgāyātirekaḥ kalpayitavyaḥ|
tannātireke 'pi dvayāpekṣāyāḥ kasya kasmāditi tulyatvādatirekopalakṣitasya jīvatve tasya ca jñānānnivartyatve 'jñānapakṣānna viśiṣyate viśiṣṭasya jīvatve 'nirmokṣaḥ|
ato yatkiṃcidetat|
nāpi dhīmātrameva jīvopādhistadapratītāvapi suṣupte jīvapratīteḥ|
tasmādavidyaiva bhedikā|

sā cāparokṣajñānādeva kārtsnyena nivartate|
taccāparokṣajñānaṃ śabdādevetyāha---

viṣayotpannataḥ saṃvidaikyādvājñānahānataḥ|
svato 'siddherataḥ śabdādāparokṣyaṃ prajāyate|| 71

loke 'pi saṃvedanasya viṣayotpannatvādvā viṣayasya saṃvidaikyādvā viṣayasya cetanaprakṛtikatayā svayameva cetanenābhinnasyāvaraṇadhvaṃsādvāparokṣyāttannimittaṃ jñānamaparokṣajñānamityucyate na jñānasya svato 'parokṣatāmātrānnāpi tajjanyasaṃvedanasya|
evaṃ brahmaṇyapi śābdajñānanimittaṃ saṃvedanaṃ brahmaprakṛtikaṃ brahmābhinnaṃ sarvacaitanyānāṃ brahmaprakṛtikatvādvā svayaṃprakāśasyāvaraṇadhvaṃsādvāparokṣa ātmani pratyayatvādvāhaṃpratyayavat|
tannimittaṃ jñānamaparokṣajñānamityucyate|

saṃjāte 'pi śabdāttathāvidhe jñāne 'sambhāvanādidoṣādavidyāsaṃskārabalādvā parokṣamiva bhramādavabhāsate|
tacca manananididhyāsanādibhirvimalīkaraṇātsūkṣmavastvālocanakṣameṇa manasā śarīrendriyavyatirikte ca tvaṃpadārthe pratyakṣato 'vabhāsamāne brahmātmajñānākāreṇa pariṇamamānena manasā sthirībhāvātkṣaṇadvayavartināgnineva kṣaṇamātreṇādāhakenāpi kṣaṇadvayavartinā dahyate|
tataśca tatsiddhamityāha---

ato niḥśreyasaprāptestādarthyācchābdanirṇayaḥ|
viśiṣṭaphalasambandhī śrotavyo 'yaṃ bubhutsunā|| 72

viditasakalavedyairna praśaṃsanti loke
grathitamapi mahadbhiḥ kiṃ punarmādṛśena|
iti viphalasame 'sminvāgvyaye 'haṃ pravṛttaḥ 
svamativimalatāyai kṣantumarhanti santaḥ|| 73

vande tamātmasambuddhasphuradbrahmātmabhāvataḥ|
arthato 'pi na nāmnaiva yo 'nanyānubhavo guruḥ|| 74

prakāśātmayatīndreṇa praṇipatya janārdanam|
pratibodhāya bālānāṃ praṇītaḥ śābdanirṇayaḥ|| 75

